count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T13:36:47Z","email":"anand.jayaseelan@clarivex.tech","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"message":"fix(storybook): upgrade to Storybook 10 for Angular 21 compatibility\n\n@storybook/angular@8.x requires @angular-devkit/architect >=0.1500.0 <0.2000.0\nwhich caps at Angular 19. Storybook 10 widens the range to <0.2200.0,\ncovering Angular 21 (architect 0.2102.x).\n\n- Upgrade storybook + @storybook/angular from ^8.6.0 to ^10.3.6\n- Remove @storybook/addon-essentials (merged into storybook core in v10)\n- Clear addons[] in .storybook/main.ts (essentials built-in to v10)\n- Add .npmrc with legacy-peer-deps=true so npm ci on CI resolves\n  the same way as local npm install (Angular ecosystem peer ranges\n  are intentionally broad and safe to relax)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3dc1be2a9b53bae61a55a65ba9ed114142e21b65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/trees/3dc1be2a9b53bae61a55a65ba9ed114142e21b65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/commits/5f6f3d8f7a869332ceae749ccabfaa13efadf4ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276426437?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anand-clarivex","id":276426437,"login":"anand-clarivex","node_id":"U_kgDOEHnuxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/repos","site_admin":