port 4201\n- ProductListPage: CanvasGridComponent + BadgeCellRendererComponent\n- ProductDetailPage: FormEngineComponent with input() route param\n- i18n asset at src/assets/i18n/en.json\n\nE2E — Playwright (canvas-shell-e2e):\n- shell-navigation.spec.ts: layout, sidebar, MFE loading, 404\n- auth-flow.spec.ts: OIDC login, JWT injection, auth guard, logout\n- mobile-app.spec.ts: ion-app, login, home, touch target sizing\n- @playwright/test added to package.json devDependencies\n- npm run e2e convenience script\n\nLocal dev stack:\n- docker-compose.yml: Keycloak (OIDC) + json-server (registry + API)\n- documents/canvas/registry-db.json + registry-routes.json: json-server data\n- documents/canvas/api-db.json: mock products data\n- documents/canvas/localstack-guide.md: full setup walkthrough\n- documents/canvas/performance-baseline.md: Lighthouse + bundle targets\n- README.md: local setup, serve commands, app table, structure diagram\n\nBlueprint: Phase 8 complete (118/134 tasks done)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02f39a255ce9cf13c86a411035f7f9d4c9a89b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/trees/02f39a255ce9cf13c86a411035f7f9d4c9a89b25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/commits/5de5589304db3cd0033510e239309ac2fffd3634","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276426437?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anand-clarivex","id":276426437,"login":"anand-clarivex","node_id":"U_kgDOEHnuxQ","organizations_url":"h