-tech/pervaxis-canvas/commits/3611b8882d05c21f17977b42612803a2034fb557/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T20:22:29Z","email":"anand.jayaseelan@clarivex.tech","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T20:22:29Z","email":"anand.jayaseelan@clarivex.tech","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"message":"feat(components): implement canvas-components-web and canvas-components-mobile libraries\n\ncanvas-components-web (@pervaxis/canvas-components-web):\n- Design tokens (_canvas-tokens.scss) and SCSS mixins (_canvas-mixins.scss) — full --canvas-* CSS custom property system\n- PageComponent, SectionComponent, DataViewComponent (layout shells)\n- FormEngineComponent — schema-driven reactive forms with CanvasFormControlComponent\n- form-types.ts, form-validators.ts — FieldConfig schema + Angular validator builder\n- CanvasGridComponent — ag-Grid v33 wrapper with Canvas theming defaults\n- TextCellEditorComponent, BadgeCellRendererComponent (cell plugins)\n- CanvasChartComponent — ECharts base with ECHARTS_INIT DI token + ResizeObserver\n- BarChartComponent, LineChartComponent, PieChartComponent, GaugeChartComponent\n- 50 unit tests, all passing\n\ncanvas-components-mobile (@pervaxis/canvas-components-mobile):\n- _canvas-mobile-tokens.scss — safe-area insets, touch targets, tab-bar sizing\n- MobileListComponent — ion-list with pull-to-refresh and infinite scroll\n- MobileFormComponent — Ionic form with same FormSchema contract as web engine\n- MobileChartComponent — ECharts mobile wrapper with MOBILE_ECHARTS_INIT DI token\n- MobileNavService — NavController wrapper for tab nav and stack push/pop\n- 36 unit tests, all passing\n\nInfrastructure:\n- tsconfig.base.json path aliases for @pervaxis/canvas-components-web and mobile\n- Blueprint.md Phase 5 marked complete (86/134 total tasks done)\n- TASKS.md updated with Phase 5 completion details\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e50dc3eaf791b26265ccc56d8