without knowing other keys\n- withCanvasDevTools(name): NgRx Signals store feature that bridges any\n  signalStore to the Redux DevTools browser extension via watchState;\n  no-op when extension is absent — guard with isDevMode() at call site\n- provideCanvasState(): binds SharedStateService to CANVAS_SHARED_STATE\n  InjectionToken so MFEs consume via token without concrete dependency\n- 18 tests, 100% coverage | lint ✅ | build ✅\n\nDependencies:\n- Installed @ngrx/signals@^21.1.0\n\nBlueprint: Phase 2 updated (17/18 tasks done, 1 remaining)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f17963be4823e18387316ff9472ac67fe615caee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/trees/f17963be4823e18387316ff9472ac67fe615caee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/commits/ec6f18585ad0642b3176f35f78cd755a975145ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276426437?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anand-clarivex","id":276426437,"login":"anand-clarivex","node_id":"U_kgDOEHnuxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex","us