":"anand.jayaseelan@clarivex.tech","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"message":"feat(platform): implement canvas-mfe-contracts and canvas-platform-auth\n\ncanvas-mfe-contracts (@pervaxis/canvas-mfe-contracts):\n- MfeManifest, RouteContract, AuthContext, CanvasEvent, EventBus types\n- CANVAS_AUTH_CONTEXT, CANVAS_EVENT_BUS, CANVAS_SHARED_STATE InjectionTokens\n- 6 tests, 100% coverage | lint ✅ | build ✅\n\ncanvas-platform-auth (@pervaxis/canvas-platform-auth):\n- AuthContextService: signal-based user context (context, isAuthenticated,\n  roles, permissions signals; setContext, clearContext, hasRole, hasPermission)\n- HasPermissionDirective: structural directive (*hasPermission)\n- HasRoleDirective: structural directive (*hasRole)\n- authGuard: functional CanActivateFn, redirects to /login\n- permissionGuard: reads route.data.permissions, redirects to /forbidden\n- 41 tests, 100% coverage | lint ✅ | build ✅\n\nInfrastructure fixes:\n- tsconfig.lib.prod.json: override paths to use dist for cross-lib builds\n- eslint.config.mjs: ignoredDependencies for workspace lib scanner limitation\n- Blueprint: Phase 2 progress updated (12/18 tasks done)\n- Challenges/LessonsLearnt: C006/L006 documenting rootDir fix pattern\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f0e34c6efc84de99b1ceac2eb23e51e859d8778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/trees/8f0e34c6efc84de99b1ceac2eb23e51e859d8778"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/commits/e8f95c167789dd3f95f1f42d59387aa3f86ad8c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276426437?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/following{/other_user}","g