pi.github.com/users/anand-clarivex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/commits/6fc09729c7bd52f03ba16c2ce5eae4e51e6af5eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T14:43:16Z","email":"anand.jayaseelan@clarivex.tech","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T14:43:16Z","email":"anand.jayaseelan@clarivex.tech","name":"Anand Jayaseelan"},"message":"feat(platform-http): implement canvas-platform-http library\n\nDelivers the full @pervaxis/canvas-platform-http platform library:\n\n- correlationIdInterceptor — stamps X-Correlation-Id on every request\n- retryInterceptor — exponential backoff retry (status 0, 429, 5xx)\n- timeoutInterceptor — global + per-request timeout via HttpContextToken\n- errorNormalizerInterceptor — maps HttpErrorResponse → CanvasHttpError\n- provideCanvasHttp() — single provider entry point with optional config override\n- CANVAS_HTTP_CONFIG InjectionToken with sensible defaults (3 retries, 30s timeout)\n- withTimeout() helper for ergonomic per-request timeout context\n- isCanvasHttpError() type guard for downstream error handling\n\n37 tests passing, 94.73% coverage (above 90% target)\nBuild: ✅  Lint: ✅  Tests: ✅\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"464f4c6303fef52703c3cafbe704737c801ae9d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/trees/464f4c6303fef52703c3cafbe704737c801ae9d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarivex-tech/pervaxis-canvas/git/commits/6fc09729c7bd52f03ba16c2ce5eae4e51e6af5eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276426437?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anand-clarivex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ana