\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c34c51f16da206432e757146661bcee5bfcf816","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/4c34c51f16da206432e757146661bcee5bfcf816"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/commits/9b36dded7d4b8526642b5ec079c5e19b7724da42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/9b36dded7d4b8526642b5ec079c5e19b7724da42","node_id":"C_kwDOSRWPZdoAKDliMzZkZGVkN2Q0Yjg1MjY2NDJiNWVjMDc5YzVlMTliNzcyNGRhNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a","sha":"a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a"}],"sha":"9b36dded7d4b8526642b5ec079c5e19b7724da42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/9b36dded7d4b8526642b5ec079c5e19b7724da42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:54:08Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:54:08Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"message":"Restore desktop ask FAB and move mod controls to the top-left\n\nThe \".display-screen > * { position: relative }\" rule was forcing\nposition: relative on every direct child, which overrode the FAB''s\nposition: fixed and pulled it back into the layout flow. Exclude the\nFAB and the composer overlay from that rule so they keep their fixed\npositioning.\n\nAlso move the per-question mod controls (highlight / resolve / discard)\nfrom top-right to top-left so the buttons no longer cover the upvote\ncount and button on hover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce59e46d396e45f7231d3e3485fac7e91c12ddd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/ce59e46d396e45f7231d3e3485fac7e91c12ddd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/commits/a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a","node_id":"C_kwDOSRWPZdoAKGExYzM5ZjkyNzdlN2ZjY2NjZTU0Mjk1MmRlZGJkZjRmODU1MjI5N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/3dff65839807ae64c5b339f29ac670a2aab98269","sha":"3dff65839807ae64c5b339f29ac670a2aab98269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/3dff65839807ae64c5b339f29ac670a2aab98269"}],"sha":"a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/a1c39f9277e7fcccce542952dedbdf4f8552297a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/3dff65839807ae64c5b339f29ac670a2aab98269/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:50:03Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:50:03Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"message":"Add a top-question query and make the desktop feed scroll\n\nThe audience hero card now uses a dedicated findTopVisibleQuestionBy\nSessionSlug query that returns the highlighted question if there is\none, otherwise the most-voted visible question (oldest wins ties). The\nlist below renders in chronological order with the top question\nfiltered out by id, so the same question never appears twice.\n\nAlso fix the page-overflow scrollbar on mobile (display-screen is now a\nfixed-height flex column with overflow hidden, audience-stack flexes\ninto the remaining space) and make the desktop \"Up next\" feed\nscrollable inside the split-feed column the same way the mobile queue\ndoes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77e120351bd62e0a7a7b9e6e31152aad43f1d609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/77e120351bd62e0a7a7b9e6e31152aad43f1d609"},"url":"https://api