ved_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/127c92ed5048615483ee0ad6d7a767837f5562c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:35:37Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:35:37Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"message":"Sort questions oldest-first and pin the audience header on mobile\n\nSwitch the visible question list from \"highlighted, then by votes desc\"\nto \"highlighted, then oldest first by updatedAt asc\". Drop the redundant\nclient-side voteCount re-sort in SessionDisplayScreen and rename the\n\"Up next · top voted\" eyebrow to just \"Up next\". Update the unit test,\nthe audience-voting BDD scenarios, and the speaker-question-controls\nordering assertions to match.\n\nPin the audience header, hero card, and \"Up next\" eyebrow at the top on\nmobile by giving .audience-stack a fixed 100dvh and overflow hidden, and\nmaking the queue the only scrollable region (flex 1, overflow-y auto,\npadding-bottom for the FAB clearance, overscroll-contain to keep the\ninertial scroll trapped).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34e66c13a5dc52338af78c649c9100d19c46a0be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/34e66c13a5dc52338af78c649c9100d19c46a0be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/commits/127c92ed5048615483ee0ad6d7a767837f5562c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/127c92ed5048615483ee0ad6d7a767837f5562c9","node_id":"C_kwDOSRWPZdoAKDEyN2M5MmVkNTA0ODYxNTQ4M2VlMGFkNmQ3YTc2NzgzN2Y1NTYyYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119","sha":"f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119"}],"sha":"127c92ed5048615483ee0ad6d7a767837f5562c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/127c92ed5048615483ee0ad6d7a767837f5562c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:03:28Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:03:28Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"message":"Drop the leftover grid rule that ballooned the audience eyebrow\n\nA second .audience-stack { display: grid } block lived further down in\nstyles.css from the original mobile/desktop layout toggle. It was\noverriding the intentional flex column at the top of the file, which\nbrought back the implicit 4-row grid and stretched the \"Up next\" row to\nfill viewport height. Removing it lets the flex layout actually apply,\nso the queue sits directly under the eyebrow instead of being pushed to\nthe bottom of the screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ee7d2a87795fe03aec940ba94b1e1a2cd8080bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/8ee7d2a87795fe03aec940ba94b1e1a2cd8080bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/commits/f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119","node_id":"C_kwDOSRWPZdoAKGY1OTgwNmY5ZmIwYjg2NWU4MTE3NDIxZDczMjYwNTM4NDBmNjExMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/99a592ad73909e96df0889bb97ec5b9719900596","sha":"99a592ad73909e96df0889bb97ec5b9719900596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/99a592ad73909e96df0889bb97ec5b9719900596"}],"sha":"f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/f59806f9fb0b865e8117421d7326053840f61119"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/99a592ad73909e96df0889bb97ec5b9719900596/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T02:57:07Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T02:57:07Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"message":"Track the VisualViewport so the composer dodges the iOS keyboard\n\n100dvh + interactive-widget=resizes-content isn''t enough on iOS Safari:\nthe layout viewport doesn''t shrink when the on-screen keyboard appears,\nso the composer footer (Your name + Post question) keeps getting hidden\nbehind the keyboard.\n\nListen on window.visualViewport while the composer is open and pin the\noverlay''s height to visualViewport.height plus a top offset for\nvisualViewport.offsetTop. The visual viewport actually does shrink when\nthe keyboard slides up, so the footer stays visible above it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fadd82b0f35ea892d3951e668917172d2f2011e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/5fadd82b0f35ea892d3951e668917172d2f2011e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/commits/99a592ad73909e96df0889bb97ec5b9719900596","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","nod