n","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/9c8c9bedee8465505cab9428086422f25dfcec4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T02:47:56Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T02:47:56Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"message":"Make the question composer a desktop modal and fill the textarea\n\nOn screens >= 760px the composer now renders as a centered 540px-wide\nmodal card with a dimmed backdrop instead of taking over the full\nviewport, which felt too big on a laptop. Below 760px it keeps the\nfull-screen full-height mobile treatment.\n\nStretch the textarea to fill all the available space between the\nheader and the footer so there isn''t a big empty band beneath it on\nmobile.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6ab41762c2dc0589c0b36a7fd4621181212a2dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/c6ab41762c2dc0589c0b36a7fd4621181212a2dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/commits/9c8c9bedee8465505cab9428086422f25dfcec4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/9c8c9bedee8465505cab9428086422f25dfcec4a","node_id":"C_kwDOSRWPZdoAKDljOGM5YmVkZWU4NDY1NTA1Y2FiOTQyODA4NjQyMmYyNWRmY2VjNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann/questions/commit/394a69106ecb94b65ac77cb818cec2ea53534de8","sha":"394a69106ecb94b65ac77cb818cec2ea53534de8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/394a69106ecb94b65ac77cb818cec2ea53534de8"}],"sha":"9c8c9bedee8465505cab9428086422f25dfcec4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/9c8c9bedee8465505cab9428086422f25dfcec4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/commits/394a69106ecb94b65ac77cb818cec2ea53534de8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T02:42:20Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T02:42:20Z","email":"mike.cann@gmail.com","name":"Mike Cann"},"message":"Show ask FAB on desktop and stop the display split overflowing\n\nThe FAB was hidden at >=900px on the assumption that desktop = projected\ndisplay, but the same URL is also viewed by audience members on a laptop\nwho need to ask a question. Drop the desktop-only display:none.\n\nAlso fix the unwanted scrollbar: the display split had min-height: 100vh\non top of the status bar above it, totalling >100vh. Make the display\nscreen a flex column so the split can flex:1 into the remaining space.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6fb745b3d10bc4b8818c591a12530c981362b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/trees/a6fb745b3d10bc4b8818c591a12530c981362b46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikecann/questions/git/commits/394a69106ecb94b65ac77cb818cec2ea53534de8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/215033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mikecann","id":215033,"login":"mikecann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTAzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikecann","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h