:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:26:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add the plan for chunked tool runs and duplicate-host reduction\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd","tree":{"sha":"899f6f150db9b10b14292e73837edffa5fc4bb6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/trees/899f6f150db9b10b14292e73837edffa5fc4bb6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/commits/d89d96b339fe09805e38153bed6063a4e9f92279","verification":{"payload":"tree 899f6f150db9b10b14292e73837edffa5fc4bb6e\nparent 4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791192377 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791192377 +0000\n\nAdd the plan for chunked tool runs and duplicate-host reduction\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDHJ56sK\n3XtJGi71BITv0sPvAUP2wbVnBGFtw/rtHr5ejUIaNMYLmP3QeCj8d5tzbSIpTqUqYJEdWFZDU8lC\niwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T09:26:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/d89d96b339fe09805e38153bed6063a4e9f92279","node_id":"C_kwDOSRkBoNoAKGQ4OWQ5NmIzMzlmZTA5ODA1ZTM4MTUzYmVkNjA2M2E0ZTlmOTIyNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b","sha":"4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b"}],"sha":"d89d96b339fe09805e38153bed6063a4e9f92279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/d89d96b339fe09805e38153bed6063a4e9f92279"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:26:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:26:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Keep the scan going when one tool in Tiers 1-6 fails\n\nAny tool activity that exhausted its retries failed MasterScanWorkflow, and\nthe finalizer then marked every later task FAILED without it having run: one\nover-long fuzzing run cost a scan its whole vulnerability assessment.\n\nTool activities in Tiers 1-6 are now awaited through _isolated_tool, which\nlogs an ActivityError and lets the scan continue. The tool''s own row keeps the\nfailure, the scan still ends FAILED, and Retry re-runs only that tool. Internal\nsteps (profiling, seeding, parsing) and a user abort still stop the scan.\nOnly the exception handling changes, so the command sequence of in-flight\nworkflows replays unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd","tree":{"sha":"bd5e74880158af367cb598d43f0430a70a772dbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/trees/bd5e74880158af367cb598d43f0430a70a772dbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/commits/4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b","verification":{"payload":"tree bd5e74880158af367cb598d43f0430a70a772dbe\nparent cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791192377 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791192377 +0000\n\nKeep the scan going when one tool in Tiers 1-6 fails\n\nAny tool activity that exhausted its retries failed MasterScanWorkflow, and\nthe finalizer then marked every later task FAILED without it having run: one\nover-long fuzzing run cost a scan its whole vulnerability assessment.\n\nTool activities in Tiers 1-6 are now awaited through _isolated_tool, which\nlogs an ActivityError and lets the scan continue. The tool''s own row keeps the\nfailure, the scan still ends FAILED, and Retry re-runs only that tool. Internal\nsteps (profiling, seeding, parsing) and a user abort still stop the scan.\nOnly the exception handling changes, so the command sequence of in-flight\nworkflows replays unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOpXwyAr\nP3o3PqK42v15AZLj8eYpUa6Ef4GjRt1k468h54txoYMnJfj8i9kexCnCqMle04cpMw/Mh2Zdp9bj\nwAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T09:26:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b","node_id":"C_kwDOSRkBoNoAKDRjMmI5OGRkZTQ4ODRhZGZkZDQwNjVjMjkxZTllNGQ3NzIyZGViOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c","sha":"cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c"}],"sha":"4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/4c2b98dde4884adfdd4065c291e9e4d7722deb8b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:26:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:26:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Stop a tool before its attempt times out and keep what it found\n\nTemporal times an attempt out on the server but cannot interrupt the worker\nthread. On a large target the dir/file fuzzer passed its 8 h limit, Temporal\nstarted attempt 2 from scratch while attempt 1''s ffuf kept running for another\nday, and the scan failed when attempt 2 timed out as well.\n\n- _run_task computes when the attempt must stop (start_to_close or\n  schedule_to_close, minus 5% capped to 1-10 minutes) and sets the task''s\n  cancel event then.\n- stream_command starts no new command once the event is set, and its\n  watchdog now kills a locally run tool on the event too; routed tools were\n  already cancelled by it.\n- An activity stopped this way finishes as SUCCESS with a note (\"Stopped at\n  its 8 h time limit; the results found until then were kept\"), so Temporal\n  does not re-run hours of work. A failure after the stop is non-retryable.\n- The timeline shows such a note in amber on the completed row instead of a\n  red ERROR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd","tree":{"sha":"16caf2833d302ad68711451f3f60da4360f94537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/trees/16caf2833d302ad68711451f3f60da4360f94537"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/commits/cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c","verification":{"payload":"tree 16caf2833d302ad68711451f3f60da4360f94537\nparent 5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791192376 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791192376 +0000\n\nStop a tool before its attempt times out and keep what it found\n\nTemporal times an attempt out on the server but cannot interrupt the worker\nthread. On a large target the dir/file fuzzer passed its 8 h limit, Temporal\nstarted attempt 2 from scratch while attempt 1''s ffuf kept running for another\nday, and the scan failed when attempt 2 timed out as well.\n\n- _run_task computes when the attempt must stop (start_to_close or\n  schedule_to_close, minus 5% capped to 1-10 minutes) and sets the task''s\n  cancel event then.\n- stream_command starts no new command once the event is set, and its\n  watchdog now kills a locally run tool on the event too; routed tools were\n  already cancelled by it.\n- An activity stopped this way finishes as SUCCESS with a note (\"Stopped at\n  its 8 h time limit; the results found until then were kept\"), so Temporal\n  does not re-run hours of work. A failure after the stop is non-retryable.\n- The timeline shows such a note in amber on the completed row instead of a\n  red ERROR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNKoKlfW\njF5VMp9gv5XS+UvE89ee3uurInsoe74sZsZynkUxlX8e8NFR76uZdNOcUtQlBCHd3Y8YV/8IOoMc\nawU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T09:26:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c","node_id":"C_kwDOSRkBoNoAKGNjZTFlN2VjMWRkOWRlNTgwYTA1MTcxOThiN2I1MDA1NWNiMTMwNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2","sha":"5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2"}],"sha":"cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/cce1e7ec1dd9de580a0517198b7b50055cb1306c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:56:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:56:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Show timeline rows the scan never reached as \"Did not run\"\n\nWhen a scan workflow fails, finalize_failed_scan stamps the scan''s own error\non every planned row that never started. The timeline then showed each of\nthem as a failure of its own, e.g. Nuclei with \"Time limit exceeded /\nActivity task timed out\", although Nuclei never ran. The tier header already\ncounted these as not run; the rows now say \"Did not run\" and show the scan\nerror as context instead of as the task''s failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd","tree":{"sha":"4f4cfb6ea1f08e2b7c9b28f0061572d6956d5fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/trees/4f4cfb6ea1f08e2b7c9b28f0061572d6956d5fba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/commits/5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f4cfb6ea1f08e2b7c9b28f0061572d6956d5fba\nparent 7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791190614 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791190614 +0000\n\nShow timeline rows the scan never reached as \"Did not run\"\n\nWhen a scan workflow fails, finalize_failed_scan stamps the scan''s own error\non every planned row that never started. The timeline then showed each of\nthem as a failure of its own, e.g. Nuclei with \"Time limit exceeded /\nActivity task timed out\", although Nuclei never ran. The tier header already\ncounted these as not run; the rows now say \"Did not run\" and show the scan\nerror as context instead of as the task''s failure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD3BRCp0\nLWODDBRpoGB6PZXpur/ec4kPy3wvvalPARk/amoy6Vwm4xWsEXmRpJsr+39/0JmlbkH554MsvGE+\nFgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T08:56:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2","node_id":"C_kwDOSRkBoNoAKDVjZmQ1NWNiNTY4NzJkOTlhZmQwMjNkNzZiZDE2ZDA3OGUzODQ1ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635","sha":"7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635"}],"sha":"5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/5cfd55cb56872d99afd023d76bd16d078e3845d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:53:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:53:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Skip www.<host> in Acunetix submission when <host> itself is live\n\nBoth names serve the same site, so each live subdomain with a www twin was\nregistered and scanned twice. The www name is now recorded as \"SKIPPED —\nsame site as <host>\"; it is still sent when the bare host is not live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd","tree":{"sha":"437e47968215604b30bc700b1874b83d06375240","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/trees/437e47968215604b30bc700b1874b83d06375240"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/commits/7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635","verification":{"payload":"tree 437e47968215604b30bc700b1874b83d06375240\nparent 8121b306dbcab8c8920341876ffcb5255a61e572\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791190382 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791190382 +0000\n\nSkip www.<host> in Acunetix submission when <host> itself is live\n\nBoth names serve the same site, so each live subdomain with a www twin was\nregistered and scanned twice. The www name is now recorded as \"SKIPPED —\nsame site as <host>\"; it is still sent when the bare host is not live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQG3MCL4i\nuW9TQIdRX0puPZVjXbD1Ehg5omsfrWF4NOIoycR0hiN1oAsGjNdT3RUJHMk2GEZxkxzlGzqGDSQL\nfgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T08:53:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635","node_id":"C_kwDOSRkBoNoAKDdhODI4NzI0NWE0N2E0MjAxYzAzZmJmYjg4OGE4YWNjOTBkZTA2MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commit/8121b306dbcab8c8920341876ffcb5255a61e572","sha":"8121b306dbcab8c8920341876ffcb5255a61e572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/8121b306dbcab8c8920341876ffcb5255a61e572"}],"sha":"7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/7a8287245a47a4201c03fbfb888a8acc90de0635"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/commits/8121b306dbcab8c8920341876ffcb5255a61e572/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:41:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:41:20Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Print only errors to the console during local and CI test runs\n\nA passing suite printed about 9,600 lines, almost all INFO/DEBUG logging from\nthe code under test (stream_command output, APME rule loading), which buried\nreal failures. The console and task handlers now default to ERROR in\nsettings_test_local; RENGINE_TEST_LOG_LEVEL overrides it. assertLogs attaches\nits own handler, so tests that check log output are unaffected. The same run\nnow prints about 740 lines.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd","tree":{"sha":"2c85be5ff79f8cc0158a58110f1d533acee92d6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/trees/2c85be5ff79f8cc0158a58110f1d533acee92d6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whiterabb17/r3ngine/git/commits/8121b306dbcab8c8920341876ffcb5255a61e572","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c85be5ff79f8cc0158a58110f1d533acee92d6e\nparent ae6738297f61e04478f88721cc13947f2da00c06\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791189680 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791189680 +0000\n\nPrint only errors to the console during local and CI test runs\n\nA passing suite printed about 9,600 lines, almost all INFO/DEBUG logging from\nthe code under test (stream_command output, APME rule loading), which buried\nreal failures. The console and task handlers now default to ERROR in\nsettings_test_local; RENGINE_TEST_LOG_LEVEL overrides it. assertLogs attaches\nits own handler, so tests that check log output are unaffected. The same run\nnow prints about 740 lines.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01E9ec9vQzQn9kv2Eukv4Rcd\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGv7rfIE\nQf1fes96f68JGunA17l0/lbXFj1CHHAXzpSR+Lt5cwoClmZXvRL8N0lk2LqSRosTsq0I571OC1uM\n1gA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T08:41:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","u