md with:\n  * Comprehensive metric analysis\n  * Training convergence plots\n  * Statistical analysis and interpretations\n  * Performance comparisons\n  * Real-world implications\n\nKey Metrics:\n- Speaker Similarity: 0.8204 → 0.8446 (+2.94%)\n- F0 Correlation: -0.164 → +0.0925 (+156.4%)\n- Energy Correlation: 0.0901 → 0.1806 (+100.4%)\n- SNR Quality: 40.33dB → 44.00dB (+9.1%)\n- Training Data: 38.68 minutes across 577 audio files\n- Training Time: ~15-20 minutes on RTX 4090","tree":{"sha":"45090350e9aea2a06e3fc41ea0f3b8d4429b9cf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mustafa-bacha/SpeechEcho/git/trees/45090350e9aea2a06e3fc41ea0f3b8d4429b9cf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mustafa-bacha/SpeechEcho/git/commits/b1aeee946c276a175c4afa3d917ddfdb5d39ce86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137509109?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mustafa-bacha","id":137509109,"login":"Mustafa-bacha","node_id":"U_kgDOCDI49Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mustafa-bacha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Mustafa-bacha/SpeechEcho/commit/b1aeee946c276a175c4afa3d917ddfdb5d39ce86","node_id":"C_kwDOSRop