low/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/commit/0a8b09712f3bbd63169771f819af12330ee59165","node_id":"C_kwDOSRyBs9oAKDBhOGIwOTcxMmYzYmJkNjMxNjk3NzFmODE5YWYxMjMzMGVlNTkxNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/commit/e00d084062225677e06a87b394255c663558784e","sha":"e00d084062225677e06a87b394255c663558784e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/commits/e00d084062225677e06a87b394255c663558784e"}],"sha":"0a8b09712f3bbd63169771f819af12330ee59165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/commits/0a8b09712f3bbd63169771f819af12330ee59165"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12331140?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Arc-E-Tect","id":12331140,"login":"Arc-E-Tect","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzMxMTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/commits/e00d084062225677e06a87b394255c663558784e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T21:43:21Z","email":"iwan@arc-e-tect.com","name":"Iwan Eising"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T21:43:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add an example of the MFA pattern showing request and response payload shaping (#2)\n\nImplements examples/mfa-example-payload-shaping/ — a complete end-to-end\nMFA example that extends the vanilla-mfa example with JSON payload shaping:\nDutch field names on the MFE/MFA surface are transparently translated to\nEnglish field names on the microservice surface, and vice versa.\n\nCopied from examples/mfa-example-vanilla/ and modified as follows.\n\n**Phase 0 — rename vanilla → payload-shaper**\n- `application-vanilla.yml` → `application-payload-shaper.yml`\n- `VanillaWebClientConfiguration` → `PayloadShaperWebClientConfiguration`\n  (`@Profile(\"payload-shaper\")`)\n- `VanillaInnerTokenServiceAdapter` → `PayloadShaperInnerTokenServiceAdapter`\n  (`@Profile(\"payload-shaper\")`)\n- `VanillaSessionStoreAdapter` → `PayloadShaperSessionStoreAdapter`\n- All `@Profile(\"!vanilla\")` annotations replaced with\n  `@Profile(\"!payload-shaper\")` on the seven beans that must not activate\n  under this profile\n- `docker-compose.yml`: image names and `SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE` updated\n- `mfe/package.json`: name changed to `payload-shaping-mfe`\n- `mfa/build.gradle`: `systemProperty ''spring.profiles.active'', ''payload-shaper''`\n\n**Phase 1 — Dutch OpenAPI schemas**\nFour new files under `openapi/components/mfa/`:\n- `DutchPersonRequest.yaml` (voornaam, achternaam)\n- `DutchPersonResponse.yaml` (voornaam, achternaam)\n- `DutchRelationshipRequest.yaml` (vanVoornaam, vanAchternaam, naarVoornaam,\n  naarAchternaam, soort)\n- `DutchRelationshipResponse.yaml` (id, vanPersoon, naarPersoon, soort)\n\n`openapi/mfa-api.yaml` updated to reference Dutch schemas for all MFA\nendpoints.\n\n**Phase 2 — transformer SPI beans**\nNew files under `mfa/src/main/java/.../`:\n- `domain/spi/DutchToEnglishRequestTransformer.java` — implements\n  `RequestTransformer`; recursively renames Dutch JSON keys to English\n  before the request is forwarded to the MS\n- `domain/spi/EnglishToDutchResponseTransformer.java` — implements\n  `ResponseTransformer`; recursively renames English JSON keys to Dutch\n  in both object and array responses\n- `infrastructure/config/PayloadShapingConfiguration.java` — declares\n  both transformer beans under `@Profile(\"payload-shaper\")`; injects the\n  auto-configured `ObjectMapper`\n\nBoth transformers use `Jackson ObjectMapper` for structure-aware key renaming\n(avoids corrupting field values that happen to contain key-name substrings).\nUnknown fields pass through unchanged. Non-JSON bodies are returned unchanged.\n\n**Phase 3 — Dutchified MFE**\n- `app.ts`: title `''Familiebanden MFE''`\n- `app.html`: Dutch subtitle and nav labels (Personen, Relaties, Systeem)\n- `app.spec.ts`: assertion updated\n- `persons.service.ts`: `PersonRequest`/`PersonResponse` use `voornaam`,\n  `achternaam`\n- `persons.component.ts` and `.html`: Dutch form fields, labels, placeholders\n  (Persoon toevoegen, Zoek op achternaam, Persoon verwijderen)\n- `relationships.service.ts`: `RelationshipRequest` uses `vanVoornaam`,\n  `vanAchternaam`, `naarVoornaam`, `naarAchternaam`, `soort`;\n  `RelationshipResponse` uses `vanPersoon`, `naarPersoon`, `soort`\n- `relationships.component.ts` and `.html`: Dutch form fields and labels\n  (Relatie toevoegen, Zoek relaties)\n- `system.component.html`: Dutch labels (Microservice Gezondheid, Vernieuwen)\n\n**Phase 4 — unit tests**\nNew test files under `mfa/src/test/.../domain/spi/`:\n- `DutchToEnglishRequestTransformerTest.java` — covers `supports()` for empty\n  and non-empty body, `transform()` for PersonRequest, RelationshipRequest,\n  unknown-field passthrough, and non-JSON graceful degradation\n- `EnglishToDutchResponseTransformerTest.java` — covers `supports()`, object\n  response, nested relationship response, JSON array response, and non-JSON\n  graceful degradation\n\n**Phase 5 — documentation**\n- `docs/derivation-guide.adoc` (new): step-by-step explanation of every change\n  relative to vanilla-mfa, the field-name mapping table, and design decisions\n  (recursive Jackson renaming, injected ObjectMapper, unchanged MS module)\n- `README.adoc` (replaced): payload-shaping–specific content — architecture\n  diagram, running instructions, field-name table, module layout","tree":{"sha":"bd2ee54750ef5b9b3b41c5277523f7991e8a99e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/git/trees/bd2ee54750ef5b9b3b41c5277523f7991e8a99e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/git/commits/e00d084062225677e06a87b394255c663558784e","verification":{"payload":"tree bd2ee54750ef5b9b3b41c5277523f7991e8a99e8\nparent 6f4e664f82c1197ab72ba6a7fff551cac9e5f520\nauthor Iwan Eising <iwan@arc-e-tect.com> 1778881401 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778881401 -0700\n\nfeat: add an example of the MFA pattern showing request and response payload shaping (#2)\n\nImplements examples/mfa-example-payload-shaping/ — a complete end-to-end\nMFA example that extends the vanilla-mfa example with JSON payload shaping:\nDutch field names on the MFE/MFA surface are transparently translated to\nEnglish field names on the microservice surface, and vice versa.\n\nCopied from examples/mfa-example-vanilla/ and modified as follows.\n\n**Phase 0 — rename vanilla → payload-shaper**\n- `application-vanilla.yml` → `application-payload-shaper.yml`\n- `VanillaWebClientConfiguration` → `PayloadShaperWebClientConfiguration`\n  (`@Profile(\"payload-shaper\")`)\n- `VanillaInnerTokenServiceAdapter` → `PayloadShaperInnerTokenServiceAdapter`\n  (`@Profile(\"payload-shaper\")`)\n- `VanillaSessionStoreAdapter` → `PayloadShaperSessionStoreAdapter`\n- All `@Profile(\"!vanilla\")` annotations replaced with\n  `@Profile(\"!payload-shaper\")` on the seven beans that must not activate\n  under this profile\n- `docker-compose.yml`: image names and `SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE` updated\n- `mfe/package.json`: name changed to `payload-shaping-mfe`\n- `mfa/build.gradle`: `systemProperty ''spring.profiles.active'', ''payload-shaper''`\n\n**Phase 1 — Dutch OpenAPI schemas**\nFour new files under `openapi/components/mfa/`:\n- `DutchPersonRequest.yaml` (voornaam, achternaam)\n- `DutchPersonResponse.yaml` (voornaam, achternaam)\n- `DutchRelationshipRequest.yaml` (vanVoornaam, vanAchternaam, naarVoornaam,\n  naarAchternaam, soort)\n- `DutchRelationshipResponse.yaml` (id, vanPersoon, naarPersoon, soort)\n\n`openapi/mfa-api.yaml` updated to reference Dutch schemas for all MFA\nendpoints.\n\n**Phase 2 — transformer SPI beans**\nNew files under `mfa/src/main/java/.../`:\n- `domain/spi/DutchToEnglishRequestTransformer.java` — implements\n  `RequestTransformer`; recursively renames Dutch JSON keys to English\n  before the request is forwarded to the MS\n- `domain/spi/EnglishToDutchResponseTransformer.java` — implements\n  `ResponseTransformer`; recursively renames English JSON keys to Dutch\n  in both object and array responses\n- `infrastructure/config/PayloadShapingConfiguration.java` — declares\n  both transformer beans under `@Profile(\"payload-shaper\")`; injects the\n  auto-configured `ObjectMapper`\n\nBoth transformers use `Jackson ObjectMapper` for structure-aware key renaming\n(avoids corrupting field values that happen to contain key-name substrings).\nUnknown fields pass through unchanged. Non-JSON bodies are returned unchanged.\n\n**Phase 3 — Dutchified MFE**\n- `app.ts`: title `''Familiebanden MFE''`\n- `app.html`: Dutch subtitle and nav labels (Personen, Relaties, Systeem)\n- `app.spec.ts`: assertion updated\n- `persons.service.ts`: `PersonRequest`/`PersonResponse` use `voornaam`,\n  `achternaam`\n- `persons.component.ts` and `.html`: Dutch form fields, labels, placeholders\n  (Persoon toevoegen, Zoek op achternaam, Persoon verwijderen)\n- `relationships.service.ts`: `RelationshipRequest` uses `vanVoornaam`,\n  `vanAchternaam`, `naarVoornaam`, `naarAchternaam`, `soort`;\n  `RelationshipResponse` uses `vanPersoon`, `naarPersoon`, `soort`\n- `relationships.component.ts` and `.html`: Dutch form fields and labels\n  (Relatie toevoegen, Zoek relaties)\n- `system.component.html`: Dutch labels (Microservice Gezondheid, Vernieuwen)\n\n**Phase 4 — unit tests**\nNew test files under `mfa/src/test/.../domain/spi/`:\n- `DutchToEnglishRequestTransformerTest.java` — covers `supports()` for empty\n  and non-empty body, `transform()` for PersonRequest, RelationshipRequest,\n  unknown-field passthrough, and non-JSON graceful degradation\n- `EnglishToDutchResponseTransformerTest.java` — covers `supports()`, object\n  response, nested relationship response, JSON array response, and non-JSON\n  graceful degradation\n\n**Phase 5 — documentation**\n- `docs/derivation-guide.adoc` (new): step-by-step explanation of every change\n  relative to vanilla-mfa, the field-name mapping table, and design decisions\n  (recursive Jackson renaming, injected ObjectMapper, unchanged MS module)\n- `README.adoc` (replaced): payload-shaping–specific content — architecture\n  diagram, running instructions, field-name table, module layout","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqB5N5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAACYQAGTdT2I83OsXe+2bkYxtKh9V\nEzO7Pw4qyHAUQgrnd9wIO6bU0wfyTh6zY128dDYPAcmX/Iihzs71TqcgrE+7Gq4e\nAkjWgNgQMikT1Q8g1P05OrYx47C9BeiRXufk/OUHcWZrpodFQrw0wKWmmJbgJ1qG\nG7XkjCxHPBApWEtWNH3yLHLhB4vEL9YZzSd+h4+RxHkv1Eq+1IEn/V/D5yenoByg\nJ0HfRpxKsKju0gdDrzsTjaQLHWhm+cRLLOa4Ryuc8vCZqmoxbmtYbjXbmL/W8Wsm\nYXDA9uG+Oeiiow8Icu8qfxKlsIBFnaFEmHTUZMRQ2sa3FVTCIKqlRpIaue3lgK8h\n52dzZ4HoII/5tMjgtOxGb6eIt+VLdE/8sx7zctBBWux621WTxnGVVeOG8j0v8aB6\nMPcIA9l+OaNwSwh8xBKIEbijbpMeXQ7AKCDkqlA