api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arc-E-Tect","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework/commits/bda64cc640e662956b167847859494210ec8761d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T16:48:32Z","email":"iwan@arc-e-tect.com","name":"Iwan Eising"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T16:48:32Z","email":"iwan@arc-e-tect.com","name":"Iwan Eising"},"message":"feat(security): establish hardening baseline with git hooks, policies, workflows\n\n- Add pre-commit hook for secret detection and keystore protection\n- Add pre-push hook for PR status validation and semantic-release config check\n- Implement zero-credentials policy with SECRETS_POLICY.md and ZERO_CREDENTIALS_POLICY.md\n- Configure OWASP DependencyCheck for NVD vulnerability scanning\n- Create GitHub Actions workflows for CI/CD (build-and-test, security-scan, release)\n- Configure semantic release automation with release.config.js\n- Add .env.example for environment variable documentation\n- Create CODEOWNERS file for code review requirements\n- Update .gitignore with comprehensive IDE, build, and environment exclusions\n- Initialize Gradle 9.5.0 build system with test support and JaCoCo coverage\n\nThese changes establish enterprise-grade security hardening aligned with\nSoftwareEngineeringDoneRight-Gradle standards. All commits are now validated\nfor secrets, workflows are linted, and dependencies are scanned for CVEs.","tree":{"sha":"dc0a6b7e1fdeb990d71374a969baa9759271f56d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arc-E-Tect/sedr-micro-frontend-adapter-framework