ttps://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/ec83b23535194cba2fc6076803e3cd34e70bbe53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:32:03Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:32:03Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"message":"refactor(ui): compact budget audit logs and agreement actions\n\n- Audit logs show the date (time on hover), the amount with its event\n  under it, and one line of details: \"for … · under … · by …\". The\n  funding DAO line is dropped; it is always the agency''s own DAO.\n- Edit and Delete move into a \"⋯\" menu on budget entries and agreements;\n  Renew stays visible on retainers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15d1a40e67a1270db56bd7aff562dfc009ec0e37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/15d1a40e67a1270db56bd7aff562dfc009ec0e37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/ec83b23535194cba2fc6076803e3cd34e70bbe53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46527178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ite