sts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itexpert120","id":46527178,"login":"itexpert120","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/6914d9256ea6afe81a1ddba298382785105c8171/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:02:33Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:02:33Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"message":"feat(budgets): edit and delete budget entries with history; hide prepayments\n\n- Owners and admins can edit a budget entry''s amount, budget date and\n  note, or delete it. Deleting either side of a transfer deletes both;\n  transfers can''t be edited. An edit or delete that would take a\n  project''s budget below zero is refused.\n- The previous version goes to budget_revisions (migration 0017), so the\n  audit log shows \"edited by ... · was ...\" and a deleted entries list,\n  while every other reader of budgets is unchanged.\n- Prepayments are omitted for now (prepaymentsEnabled): no tab on the\n  engagement page, no client nav item or balance card, old links go to\n  the engagement overview. Production had none. The landing page no\n  longer advertises prepayments or the Allocation plan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1603180f059da0221afc1e6bdc9631ed21807199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mult