ithub.com/users/itexpert120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/3134a898f23a94e5631c71ec2d2ac6970eb6120d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:02:04Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:02:04Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"message":"feat(reports): preview before saving, share with clients, delete, clearer history\n\n- Generate shows a preview; reports are saved only with Save, or\n  Save & share for a report filtered to one client.\n- Agency owners and admins can share and unshare a saved report with the\n  client it covers; the client sees it in their list, labelled as from the\n  agency, and is notified (report_shared).\n- Saved reports can be deleted by the person who saved them or an owner\n  or admin, on both sides. Clients cannot delete agency reports.\n- Clients never receive builder payouts (contributorStats), from their\n  own reports, previews or shared ones.\n- History is a table with a title (client, project, period), memo, saved\n  time, Shared / From agency badges and View / Share / Delete actions;\n  the open report shows above it. Admin history filters by client.\n- Admin Summary CSV includes the budget by project rows.\n- Migration 0016 adds shared_at and shared_by_user_id to report_snapshots.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"334b668f900f62d385f5ccd045c4c7f12bce3e44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/334b668f900f62d385f5ccd045c4c7f12bce3e44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/3134a898f23a94e5631c71ec2d2ac6970eb6120d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":f