\n\n- Agency managers can edit and remove a builder profile nobody has\n  claimed yet; a claimed profile stays editable only by its builder or a\n  platform admin. The builders plugin allows this for trusted in-process\n  API calls on unclaimed profiles, and an edit does not claim it.\n- Removing is refused while the builder is assigned to a Project.\n- Remove action on the Builders table and the builder page; the\n  remaining \"Unclaimed\" badge and claim wording are gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a624974eac2bd2ee49c14909a7074aa720e5066","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/9a624974eac2bd2ee49c14909a7074aa720e5066"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/b941da68762710c13c60d1a795d06459d8e66cf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46527178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itexpert120","id":46527178,"login":"itexpert120","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MultiAgency/dashboard/commit/b941da68762710c13c60d1a795d06459d