ty oRPC\n  client, alongside the existing project import.\n- Client reports: pick a single shared Project or all of them, This/Last\n  month presets, a \"who worked on what\" Builders column (no pay amounts),\n  and Download PDF via print styles. Saved reports show their Project.\n- Public /work/$slug page with description, team, repository and bounty;\n  Open on the landing and /work rows now goes there instead of /work.\n- Agency Projects page hides the NEARN column and the unlinked bounties\n  panel unless a NEARN sponsor or listing is actually in use.\n- Sign-in reads the session past the cookie cache after activating the\n  Organization, so redirects and the recommended home are honored instead\n  of falling back to My work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccd335cb04e92e40fa34e209b7ac0759a22d0594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/ccd335cb04e92e40fa34e209b7ac0759a22d0594"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/faa0d6238d20e29a3d9b3cabf98a45d376b76c7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46527178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itexpert120","id":46527178,"login":"itexpert120","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/starred{/owner}{/repo}"