mment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:41:56Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"message":"feat: recommended viewing role and top-level client pages\n\n- me.roles returns a recommendedView from the Organization''s active\n  Engagements (agency side or subcontractor vs client side). It sets the\n  default sidebar view, where sign-in lands, and where switching\n  Organization from a dashboard page goes. A manual switch still wins.\n- Client Projects and Reports stay at the top level instead of jumping\n  into one Engagement''s tabbed pages: project detail lives under\n  /client/projects/$engagementId/$slug and Reports has its own agency\n  picker. The detail and report generator are shared components used by\n  both the top-level and Engagement routes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6d28d6551f51f0ff152dbeda7e63bac0cc18958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/b6d28d6551f51f0ff152dbeda7e63bac0cc18958"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/b005ca7996d8265c240d2be15917ff4749b5da81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46527178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itexpert120","id":46527178,"login":"itexpert120","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/