"},"message":"feat: client viewing role, community project import, NEARN copy cleanup\n\n- Client-only Organizations get a client view (Projects, Reports, Agencies,\n  Team) and are kept out of agency-only pages and API routes. Orgs that are\n  both Agency and Client get an Agency/Client switch in the sidebar.\n- New /client/projects lists every shared Project with its Agency and\n  builders; /client/reports links into each Engagement''s reports.\n- Import projects from nearbuilders.org through a typed oRPC client; the\n  upstream is configurable via api variable communityApiUrl.\n- Remove stray NEARN mentions from public pages (landing card stays) and\n  show project lists as rows.\n- Simplify the mobile header: navigation, org switcher, theme and network\n  move into a slide-out menu.\n- Drop the \"Unclaimed\" tag from the Builders table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c47376963730f808e1ad9fff010fdd96f3ad6bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/4c47376963730f808e1ad9fff010fdd96f3ad6bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/1e04572c6f7cac316c1d9fb0032fd4860bc5c5c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46527178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itexpert120","id":46527178,"login":"itexpert120","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itex