te":"2026-09-29T19:27:29Z","email":"multidaomensional@gmail.com","name":"James Waugh"},"message":"fix(ui): resolve the remaining @shadcn/lint findings\n\nAdds the variants the design needs instead of restyling at call sites:\nCard destructive, muted and interactive; TableRow muted and destructive\nwith a focus-visible state; Badge counters for tab counts. Search inputs\nuse a trimmed InputGroup (fieldset and span, so Biome''s a11y rules\npass). The landing canvas uses a rendering-pixelated utility and the\nheadline drops its inline font-rendering styles. The chart legend\ncolour moves to a CSS custom property.\n\n__root.tsx and chart.tsx keep their <style> elements, so\nno-inline-styles is off for those two files only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dc254aa0bb4b9ef99eba711a85e8cb9bf00d5db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/2dc254aa0bb4b9ef99eba711a85e8cb9bf00d5db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/57ec609863f7e453f07785c976e2b73c1bb1429d","verification":{"payload":"tree 2dc254aa0bb4b9ef99eba711a85e8cb9bf00d5db\nparent 00e65e65a5c3a0f5ed61820f3180241123c012cc\nauthor Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com> 1790322511 +0500\ncommitter James Waugh <multidaomensional@gmail.com> 1790710049 -0400\n\nfix(ui): resolve the remaining @shadcn/lint findings\n\nAdds the variants the design needs instead of restyling at call sites:\nCard destructive, muted and interactive; TableRow muted and destructive\nwith a focus-visible state; Badge counters for tab counts. Search inputs\nuse a trimmed InputGroup (fieldset and span, so Biome''s a11y rules\npass). The landing canvas uses a rendering-pixelated utility and the\nheadline drops its inline font-rendering styles. The chart legend\ncolour moves to a CSS custom property.\n\n__root.tsx and chart.tsx keep their <style> elements, so\nno-inline-styles is off for those two files only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <nore