nRemoves the display font, mono-uppercase and tracked label classes and\nthe 10px and 11px text sizes, which the Lyra components now own. Text\nsizes move to text-xs and letter spacing to the theme scale. Muted\nmessages in cards use CardDescription. The unused Markdown component,\nwhose prose classes had no typography plugin behind them, is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4eb73e5c138f277e1a228c77e2a95b366dd5524e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/4eb73e5c138f277e1a228c77e2a95b366dd5524e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/b5d25ecbf46838121838a61e4db7bbf3dae56686","verification":{"payload":"tree 4eb73e5c138f277e1a228c77e2a95b366dd5524e\nparent fdfe0c4970ed0d2c5be39e8540295e62a2e9ffa6\nauthor Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com> 1790321750 +0500\ncommitter James Waugh <multidaomensional@gmail.com> 1790710042 -0400\n\nrefactor(ui): drop old-design classes flagged by @shadcn/lint\n\nRemoves the display font, mono-uppercase and tracked label classes and\nthe 10px and 11px text sizes, which the Lyra components now own. Text\nsizes move to text-xs and letter spacing to the theme scale. Muted\nmessages in cards use CardDescription. The unused Markdown component,\nwhose prose classes had no typography plugin behind them, is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgN4KCb4pwvyVOjWgyY9p17kcbWg\n2oCOUQqJRjnO/llZIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBhcDQ8QIjuuuJOEbmvkejLmHFFlpiNOexXhxa8WmthPvFKVU21RLDEmbOk5Ct4idn\nilqHSqTpBbwTMR1Je8rA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T19:52:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4283694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu