received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/fdfe0c4970ed0d2c5be39e8540295e62a2e9ffa6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T07:35:34Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:27:18Z","email":"multidaomensional@gmail.com","name":"James Waugh"},"message":"fix(ui): align the header and pin count badges to their icons\n\nEvery header control is now 28px on the header''s centre line: the logo,\nnav links, menu trigger, network toggle, organization switcher,\nnotifications, invitations and the avatar. The notification and\ninvitation counts are Badge size=\"counter\" pinned to the icon''s top\nright, capped at 9+. The network toggle shortens its labels on phones so\nthe header fits at 375px.\n\nGitHub and X move from the header and its mobile menu to the landing\npage footer, as icon buttons with the same labels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e8a038e526c68c81130574822180425105c67c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/2e8a038e526c68c81130574822180425105c67c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/fdfe0c4970ed0d2c5be39e8540295e62a2e9ffa6","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e8a038e526c68c81130574822180425105c67c9\nparent 927bc9a19b4ba5b4c67d8083d7fd15e4de0173a3\nauthor Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com> 1790321734 +0500\ncommitter James Waugh <multidaomensional@gmail.com> 1790710038 -0400\n\nfix(ui): align the header and pin count badges to their icons\n\nEvery header control is now 28px on the header''s centre line: the logo,\nnav links, menu trigger, network toggle, organization switcher,\nnotifications, invitations and the avatar. The notification and\ninvitation counts are Badge size=\"counter\" pinned to the icon''s top\nright, capped at 9+. The network toggle shortens its labels on phones so\nthe header fits at 375px.\n\nGitHub and X move from the header and its mobile menu to the landing\npage footer, as icon buttons with the same labels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgN4KCb4pwvyVOjWgyY9p17kcbWg\n2oCOUQqJRjnO/llZIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNR3oUseydpdZZjp4pv43cLl1A29GH9/IKIPUr8fxDA4P09BuUOtdR1dB/Q0XvaOra\nlilaI7EzgFmB+rFeOSfgI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T19:52:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4283694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jlwaugh","id":4283694,"login":"jlwaugh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODM2OTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MultiAgency/dashboard/commit/fdfe0c4970ed0d2c5be39e8540295e62a2e9ffa6","node_id":"C_kwDOSR2sLdoAKGZkZmUwYzQ5NzBlZDBkMmM1YmUzOWU4NTQwMjk1ZTYyYTJlOWZmYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MultiAgency/dashboard/commit/927bc9a19b4ba5b4c67d8083d7fd15e4de0173a3","sha":"927bc9a19b4ba5b4c67d8083d7fd15e4de0173a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/927bc9a19b4ba5b4c67d8083d7fd15e4de0173a3"}],"sha":"fdfe0c4970ed0d2c5be39e8540295e62a2e9ffa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/fdfe0c4970ed0d2c5be39e8540295e62a2e9ffa6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46527178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/itexpert120","id":46527178,"login":"itexpert120","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/927bc9a19b4ba5b4c67d8083d7fd15e4de0173a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T07:30:22Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:27:13Z","email":"multidaomensional@gmail.com","name":"James Waugh"},"message":"build(ui): add @shadcn/lint on Oxlint for design-system rules\n\nOxlint runs only the shadcn rules (its built-in plugins and categories\nare off), so it does not overlap Biome. Components in components/ui may\nrestyle themselves; pages get layout-only restyling, with spacing\nallowed on Card sections and typography on table cells. Run it with\n`bun run lint:shadcn` from the root or ui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bd3ed39638feb8485a7969704d9e89721e72577","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/6bd3ed39638feb8485a7969704d9e89721e72577"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/927bc9a19b4ba5b4c67d8083d7fd15e4de0173a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 6bd3ed39638feb8485a7969704d9e89721e72577\nparent a2f2f21aceec17c9ab77290547eb75864a50b967\nauthor Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com> 1790321422 +0500\ncommitter James Waugh <multidaomensional@gmail.com> 1790710033 -0400\n\nbuild(ui): add @shadcn/lint on Oxlint for design-system rules\n\nOxlint runs only the shadcn rules (its built-in plugins and categories\nare off), so it does not overlap Biome. Components in components/ui may\nrestyle themselves; pages get layout-only restyling, with spacing\nallowed on Card sections and typography on table cells. Run it with\n`bun run lint:shadcn` from the root or ui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgN4KCb4pwvyVOjWgyY9p17kcbWg\n2oCOUQqJRjnO/llZIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIh94g6bBec0Nd6U94AaUcRvuwBOQ51NLcIrMi0kNPRkpPLFRSA3/EJT75bbUoRXnF\n1dKFBOhNlvFQGgDGn8Ygw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T19:52:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4283694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlwaugh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:/