thub.com/users/itexpert120/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/itexpert120","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/commits/a2f2f21aceec17c9ab77290547eb75864a50b967/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T07:25:11Z","email":"itexpert120@outlook.com","name":"Zeeshan Ahmad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T19:27:08Z","email":"multidaomensional@gmail.com","name":"James Waugh"},"message":"feat(ui): apply the shadcn Lyra preset with Phosphor icons\n\nApplies preset b3e3keUjyq (radix-lyra, neutral base, yellow theme and\ncharts, Inter and Geist via fontsource) and reinstalls the ui components.\nThe theme is now the preset''s light and dark tokens; the old paper, ink,\nhi-vis and display-font tokens are gone.\n\nLocal customisations carried over: Card keeps a variant, now \"highlight\"\nwith a primary left rule; Field stays a fieldset and ItemGroup a ul.\nButton \"primary\" and Badge \"accent\" map to the preset''s yellow default,\nand neutral badges move to outline. lucide-react, clsx and\ntailwind-merge are replaced by Phosphor and cn. The landing canvas now\nreads the background and foreground tokens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b715e55a1a21101e599f3b35850b7cc6824da399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/trees/b715e55a1a21101e599f3b35850b7cc6824da399"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/dashboard/git/commits/a2f2f21aceec17c9ab77290547eb75864a50b967","verification":{"payload":"tree b715e55a1a21101e599f3b35850b7cc6824da399\nparent 389ae1ec4008345737281a73224967f249a4c652\nauthor Zeeshan Ahmad <itexpert120@outlook.com> 1790321111 +0500\ncommitter James Waugh <multidaomensional@gmail.com> 1790710028 -0400\n\nfeat(ui): apply the shadcn Lyra preset with Phosphor icons\n\nApplies preset b3e3keUjyq (radix-lyra, neutral base, yellow theme and\ncharts, Inter and Geist via fontsource) an