a35a8ad0f72567edb6b0793b09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:15:00Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T12:15:00Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(rural-land-offer): replace equipment scalar with reserve-expenditure list\n\nSingle \"Equipment budget\" input couldn''t capture the real planning step —\ndeciding what to do with the cash that''s left after closing. Replace with\na flexible expenditure list: each line item has a label and amount, the\nsum is what''s subtracted from totalCash to yield the final reserve.\n\nDomain:\n- New Expenditure type {id, label, amount}; OfferInputs.expenditures\n  replaces the equipment scalar.\n- ScenarioOutput.totalExpenditure surfaces the sum so the UI doesn''t\n  recompute it.\n- Validation rejects non-finite or negative amounts per row.\n\nUI: new \"Reserve cash expenditure\" section above the result region:\n- Three default rows seeded — Equipment, Stock / livestock, Home repairs\n  / improvements — at $25k / $0 / $0.\n- Per-row label input + currency input + remove button (disabled when\n  only one row remains so users can''t empty the list).\n- \"+ Add line item\" button to append custom categories.\n- Running total shown in the section footer.\n- Cash breakdown line in Proceeds Allocation now reads\n  \"− Reserve expenditure (N items)\" with the summed value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7d02e5c77d37ceee1a96b44ec4c8be5036a5456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/f7d02e5c77d37ceee1a96b44ec4c8be5036a5456"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/82d1b46bbb098ca35a8ad0f72567edb6b0793b09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/363