8452714e96d72cb040482/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:58:24Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:58:24Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"refactor(rural-land-offer): rename Surry calc → general rural framing\n\nPer the calculator-generalization sweep: Surry-County-specific identity\nbecomes a rural-flavored calc that any rural property purchase can use.\nMath was already locality-agnostic — only the heading, package name,\nsection title (\"Birchwood Sale\" → \"Current Home Sale\"), and identifier\nprefixes carried Surry/Birchwood specificity.\n\nRenames:\n- Package: calc-surry-county-offer → calc-rural-land-offer\n- Slug: /calc/surry-county-offer → /calc/rural-land-offer\n- Component: SurryCountyOfferComponent → RuralLandOfferComponent\n- Brand tokens: --calc-brand-surry* → --calc-brand-rural*\n- Subtitle expanded to describe the end-to-end flow (current-home sale\n  proceeds → down-payment → concession-against-LTV-limit → PITI/cash).\n\nSlug migration:\n- Vercel 308 redirects added for /calc/ and /embed/ paths.\n- SLUG_REDIRECTS map in routes.tsx grew an entry for in-app SPA navs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"890fe195d56a98dcd94c6bda4f26f2afe20b7299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/890fe195d56a98dcd94c6bda4f26f2afe20b7299"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/8e06d3e5b7ae675ca4a8452714e96d72cb040482","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/8e06d3e5b7ae675ca4a8452714e96d72cb040482","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKDhlMDZkM2U1YjdhZTY3NWNhNGE4NDUyNzE0ZTk2ZDcyY2IwNDA0ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504","sha":"ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504"}],"sha":"8e06d3e5b7ae675ca4a8452714e96d72cb040482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/8e06d3e5b7ae675ca4a8452714e96d72cb040482"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:23:22Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:23:22Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"refactor(rent-sell): rename Birchwood calc → generic Rent vs Sell\n\nThe Rent vs Sell math was already property-agnostic — only the heading,\npackage name, and identifier prefixes were Birchwood-specific. Rename\nthe package (calc-birchwood-rent-sell → calc-rent-sell), the slug\n(/calc/rent-sell), and all type/function/constant names while keeping\nthe existing Birchwood property values as illustrative defaults that\nusers tune via the input form. Subtitle rewritten from a Birchwood-\nspecific cue to a general \"you own a home you no longer plan to live\nin\" framing covering the 10-year horizon and Section 121 deadline.\n\nSlug migration:\n- Vercel handles full-page redirects from /calc/birchwood-rent-sell and\n  /embed/birchwood-rent-sell to the new slugs (308 permanent).\n- A SLUG_REDIRECTS map in apps/remote/src/routes.tsx handles in-app SPA\n  navigation to the same renamed slugs.\n- Brand color tokens renamed --calc-brand-birchwood* → --calc-brand-rent-sell*.\n\nAlso fixes a pre-existing LVT a11y violation surfaced by the full-suite\nrun: the City Budget tab''s RateRow nested a non-<dd> <div> inside the\n<dl> structure. Restructured to put label + value in the <dt> and the\ndescription in the <dd>, satisfying the dl-spec rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbbd53af7ef61757ab40d9fdd480ddf1fef4ea00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/bbbd53af7ef61757ab40d9fdd480ddf1fef4ea00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKGRkYjNhYWM1Njk0NWY2OGI3Yjc5YmMwZjQxZDA3NGI5M2RkNzI1MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/c8a7946f06d346c3984ac34b88db49af36b3fc76","sha":"c8a7946f06d346c3984ac34b88db49af36b3fc76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/c8a7946f06d346c3984ac34b88db49af36b3fc76"}],"sha":"ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/ddb3aac56945f68b7b79bc0f41d074b93dd72504"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/c8a7946f06d346c3984ac34b88db49af36b3fc76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T15:22:43Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T15:22:43Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(lvt): show citywide $-shift instead of sample-only sum\n\nThe Parcel Types KPI summed positive deltas across only the 7 archetype\nparcels — a misleading proxy. Replace with the actual citywide aggregate:\n(landRate − baseRate) × L, equivalent to s × baseRate × I, which is the\nbuilding-tax revenue the city no longer collects (and by revenue-neutrality\nthe extra land-tax revenue). At 50% shift this is ~$77M; at pure LVT,\n~$153.7M of the $193M target. Subline updated to \"from buildings to land,\ncitywide\", and a new intro paragraph at the top of the panel names the\naggregate first, then frames the 7-row table as illustrative of which\nparcel kinds feel that shift.\n\nAlso escapes three apostrophes in JSX strings to clear ESLint\nreact/no-unescaped-entities warnings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91d47b64d93816b271037ca75a58c0882ec2a47b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/91d47b64d93816b271037ca75a58c0882ec2a47b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/c8a7946f06d346c3984ac34b88db49af36b3fc76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/c8a7946f06d346c3984ac34b88db49af36b3fc76","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKGM4YTc5NDZmMDZkMzQ2YzM5ODRhYzM0Yjg4ZGI0OWFmMzZiM2ZjNzY","parents":[{"html_url"