ail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(lvt): expand intro, swap k-KPI for \"$X shifts\", add Raise revenue tab\n\n- Top description rewritten as three sentences (what LVT is / case for it /\n  what this calc shows) so first-time readers don''t bounce off jargon.\n- Parcel Types tab card now shows \"$X shifts\" (sum of positive deltas across\n  the 7 samples) instead of an opaque k-ratio. Honest sample-based estimate.\n- Default myParcel synced to median home (50k land / 230k imp) to match\n  SAMPLE_PARCELS[0].\n- New \"Raise revenue\" tab with an in-tab multiplier slider (1.00×-2.00×) that\n  drops revenue-neutrality. Shows new revenue total, extra above baseline,\n  and a per-parcel-class breakdown of who pays the marginal $. Optional\n  citizens'' dividend toggle (off by default, framed as a specific Georgist\n  policy proposal) reveals per-resident dividend and your net cost.\n- Domain: LvtInputs gains optional revenueScale; computeRates(shift, base,\n  scale=1) keeps existing call sites unaffected. Validation rejects\n  non-positive scales.\n- WS_POPULATION constant added (249,545 / 2020 census).\n- Tab grid: 4 cols desktop, 2 at <860px, 1 at <540px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bacc3fe28438177325fbb3eb4a428794090c7b93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/bacc3fe28438177325fbb3eb4a428794090c7b93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/e5d8f94949990a26b81d1589f2e442f077470a86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c