MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/9f86934b96a390cc2cff6b1ca7d410888a93a674/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T13:14:15Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T13:14:15Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"fix(deploy): simplify Vercel SPA rewrite to /:path*\n\nThe original negative-lookahead rewrite excluded MF artifacts from the\ncatch-all explicitly:\n\n  /((?!assets/|remoteEntry\\.js|mf-manifest\\.json|mf-stats\\.json|\n       mf-entry-bootstrap.*|favicon\\.ico|@mf-types).*)\n\nTwo problems with that on Vercel:\n- The ''@mf-types'' segment includes ''@'' which Vercel''s path-to-regexp\n  treats as a token boundary, breaking the alternation.\n- Vercel''s filesystem routing already serves real files BEFORE rewrites\n  fire, so the negative-lookahead is unnecessary defense-in-depth that\n  fails open on parse error.\n\nReplaced with the standard SPA fallback:\n\n  /:path* -> /index.html\n\nReal files (index.html, remoteEntry.js, mf-manifest.json, assets/*) are\nserved directly; only unmatched paths fall through to index.html for\nReact Router to handle.","tree":{"sha":"fe8115701f4cf9f3491fe336a46be38d8875ef2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/fe8115701f4cf9f3491fe336a46be38d8875ef2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/9f86934b