/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/dc7b6e998027c031c4fe01c56287a4c4b564787c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:25:40Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:25:40Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"chore: add @eslint/js, ignore .__mf__temp/, allow _-prefix unused\n\nThree lint fixes surfaced by the Phase 3 quality pass:\n- @eslint/js was imported in eslint.config.js but never installed; lint\n  failed at config load time. Added as a root devDep.\n- ESLint flat config now ignores **/.__mf__temp/** (MF''s debug staging\n  directory) alongside dist/build/coverage.\n- @typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars now respects varsIgnorePattern: ''^_''\n  and destructuredArrayIgnorePattern: ''^_'' so the deliberate\n  destructure-and-drop pattern in calc-{lgs,olamina}-dscr Components\n  doesn''t warn (e.g. `const { buildOverride: _drop, ...rest } = h`).\n- Removed a now-unused eslint-disable directive in federation.test.ts.\n\n`pnpm lint` is clean.","tree":{"sha":"6a047a091c8da82b176161bb599a1c0a80dea3ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/6a047a091c8da82b176161bb599a1c0a80dea3ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/dc7b6e998027c031c4fe01c56287a4c4b564787c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu