d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/74edaa335dd1000c8b5f002c05970a50a7a4e372/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:22:58Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:22:58Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U12): cross-cutting accessibility audit\n\napps/remote/tests/integration/a11y.test.tsx — axe-core integration\ntests (jest-axe + @testing-library/react) that mount each route under\nthe real CalculatorsRoutes:\n\n- 2 shell pages (HomePage, NotFoundPage)\n- 6 calcs × 2 layouts (AppLayout chrome, EmbedLayout chrome-free)\n= 14 axe assertions per CI run\n\nThreshold: fail on `critical` or `serious` violations only; lower-\nseverity findings are documented in accessibility.md as accepted issues\nwith rationale. Current state: 0 critical / 0 serious across all\n14 routes.\n\naxe color-contrast rule disabled — CSS Modules + jsdom don''t resolve\ncomputed styles reliably enough; contrast verified manually instead and\ndocumented per-calc / per-text-element in the report.\n\ndocs/accessibility.md — full audit report:\n- Automated baseline (route × layout matrix, current state)\n- Color-contrast carve-out with per-color manual ratios\n- Shared substrate notes (KTD #16 AriaLive wrapping every recompute,\n  FormField label/error/hint association)\n- Layout landmark structure (header/main/footer + skip-link in\n  AppLayout; <main> only in EmbedLayout to avoid landmark duplication\n  inside iframe consumers)\n- Manual spot-check protocol (3 calcs minimum: Surry chart-bearing,\n  LGS privacy-disclosure, Birchwood three-chart)\n- Iframe focus behavior verified in Substack draft pre-deploy\n- Page-title limitation captured (no per-route title swap at v1)\n- Accepted issues: none\n- Re-running the audit (workspace + single-calc filter)\n\nWorkspace: 302 tests across 43 files all green; typecheck clean.\n\nRefs: U12, R19, F1, F2, F3, KTD #16.","tree":{"sha":"700b2d6dd9b842a6dac32f6c569c0cbf82fab991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/700b2d6dd9b842a6dac32f6c569c0cbf82fab991"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/74edaa335dd1000c8b5f002c05970a50a7a4e372","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https