l":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/bbf9c4d1f5780e92cfaf8a8ffc863f9d47a4fcda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:18:54Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:18:54Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U10): Module Federation expose configuration\n\nWires @module-federation/vite (MF 2.0 — KTD #1) on apps/remote:\n\n- Federation `name: ''calculators''`, `manifest: true` so MF emits\n  mf-manifest.json alongside remoteEntry.js\n- 9 exposes: 3 shell components (CalculatorsApp, CalculatorsRoutes,\n  CalculatorsLoadError) + 6 per-calc components, one per package\n- Shared deps with KTD #14 trailing-slash patterns (`react/`,\n  `react-dom/`) so MF resolves react/jsx-runtime through the host''s\n  React copy — eliminates the \"Invalid hook call\" double-React bug\n- Centralized re-export module (src/exposes/index.ts) documents the\n  full federation surface in one place\n\napps/remote/tests/federation.test.ts — 4 contract assertions on the\npost-build artifact:\n- remote name matches the documented \"calculators\" identifier\n- remoteEntry.js emitted as bootstrap\n- all 9 expected expose paths present (and only these)\n- React + ReactDOM marked singleton (KTD #14 verification)\n\nThe test uses describe.runIf(existsSync) so a fresh checkout doesn''t\nfail before the first build.\n\ndocs/portfolio-integration.md — host-side integration contract:\n- Federation entry URL (placeholder for U11)\n- Full expose table with per-entry mount guidance\n- CalculatorsApp vs CalculatorsRoutes decision criterion (KTD #20)\n- Shared-deps requirements (KTD #14)\n- CalculatorsLoadError sanitization contract (KTD #5)\n- Example loadRemote usage with React 19 shared config\n- CORS gate per KTD #25 (deployment pre-condition)\n\nBuild verified locally: dist/mf-manifest.json contains all 9 exposes\nplus 4 shared-React entries with singleton: true.\n\n288 tests workspace-wide; typecheck clean. Federation entry tested\nend-to-end via U11''s deploy verification.\n\nRefs: U10, R4, R5, KTD #1, KTD #5, KTD #14, KTD #20.","tree":{"sha":"8abc999bbff6810227b24ec7c689c2c1067b940a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/8abc999bbff6810227b24ec7c689c2c1067b940a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/bbf9c4d1f5780e92cfaf8a8ffc863f9d47a4fcda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_u