,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/d1bb57f7848d7d9ca784f21b34556638126f52ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:15:00Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:15:00Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U9): Birchwood Rent vs Sell — three charts + Section 121 timeline\n\nSixth and final calc. Pure domain over fixed Birchwood scenario constants\n(mortgage balance $162,317; rate 3.75%; PI $825.74; etc. — extracted from\nthe HTML original):\n\n- monthlyCashflow(rent, managed): rent − fixed − vacancy − mgmt%\n- breakEvenRent(managed): fixed / retained-rate\n- remainingBalance(months): standard amortization loop\n- computeBirchwood: orchestrates three derived datasets — cashflowVsRent\n  (41 points, $1200..$3200 step $50), wealthOverTime (11 points, yr 0..10),\n  and sensitivity (8 points, 0..7% appreciation) — plus rentBeats /\n  rentVsSellAt10Delta and the Section 121 capital-gains timeline (safe /\n  warning / critical urgency tier based on years remaining)\n\nsrc/charts/RentVsSellCharts.tsx: three chart wrappers (CashflowChart,\nWealthChart line; SensitivityChart bar with conditional bar color).\n\nComponent renders the input card (rent + managed mode + appRate +\ninvRate + moveoutYear), four stat tiles, all three charts, and a Section\n121 timeline block with progress bar and tier-colored callout. Per\nKTD #18 NO privacy disclosure (analysis tool with hypothetical inputs).\n\n20 domain tests + 6 Component tests + 3 chart smoke + 2 federation\ncontract = 31 in this package; workspace tests 284/284 green; typecheck\nclean. All six v1 calculators now ship.\n\napps/remote registry wires Birchwood; the placeholder route test was\nremoved since every registered slug now has a Component (the unknown-\nslug path is still covered by the existing NotFoundPage assertions).\n\nRefs: U9, R2, R6, R8, R9, R10, R11, R13, R14, R17, R19, AE3, AE4,\nKTD #18.","tree":{"sha":"a545391cc06d0edea6a7f5ea1a178f97aafd7ed7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/a545391cc06d0edea6a7f5ea1a178f97aafd7ed7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/d1bb57f7848d7d9ca784f21b34556638126f52ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/d1bb57f7848d7d9ca784f21b34556638126f52ff","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKGQxYmI1N2Y3ODQ4ZDdkOWNhNzg0ZjIxYjM0NTU2NjM4MTI2ZjUyZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1","sha":"0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1"}],"sha":"d1bb57f7848d7d9ca784f21b34556638126f52ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/d1bb57f7848d7d9ca784f21b34556638126f52ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:06:23Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T05:06:23Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U8): Winston-Salem LVT calculator with split-rate chart\n\nPure domain over the static Winston-Salem tax base (L=$7.46B,\nI=$29.20B, current uniform rate $0.5266/$100):\n- computeRates(shift): inverts uniform-revenue equality to derive land/\n  improvement rates at any shift in [0, 1]. Out-of-range shifts are\n  clamped (matches HTML behavior); validation only requires finite.\n  pureLvtRate = target / L; landRate = (1−s)·uniform + s·pureLvtRate;\n  impRate = (1−s)·uniform; impliedK = landRate / impRate (∞ at pure LVT)\n- computeParcelBill: today (uniform), next (split), pure (100% LVT)\n- computeLvt: per-parcel bills for 7 sample parcels + optional\n  user-supplied parcel\n\nPer KTD #18, NO privacy disclosure (I5 is structural municipal-policy\nanalysis, not personal-loan input). Verified by Component test that\nasserts the disclosure copy is absent.\n\nsrc/parcels.ts: 7 sample parcels mirroring HTML (median home, premium\nhome, vacant lot, surface parking, dense apt, commercial strip,\nbig-box) plus the WS_BASE constants from the original.\n\nsrc/charts/ParcelComparisonChart.tsx: 3-series bar chart (today /\nsplit-rate / pure LVT) consuming @calc/charts BarChart wrapper.\n\nComponent renders the shift slider, derived rates panel, sample-parcel\ntable with conditional Δ coloring (orange = up, green = down), the\nuser-parcel block, and the chart — all routed through AriaLive.\n\n20 domain tests + 7 Component tests + 2 chart smoke tests + 2\nfederation contract tests = 31 in this package; workspace typecheck\nclean.\n\nRefs: U8, R2, R6, R8, R9, R10, R11, R13, R14, R17, R19, AE3, AE4,\nKTD #18.","tree":{"sha":"c7e24e2cd58d946cf760070078b9274c02d49f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/c7e24e2cd58d946cf760070078b9274c02d49f6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKDBhMGFkYjdhYzE1NjkwOGQ3N2Y3MjI3NzdmM2MwNzc4ZDgyM2EyYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/d780bac1d38598515750ae5be777496602b49ccc","sha":"d780bac1d38598515750ae5be777496602b49ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/d780bac1d38598515750ae5be777496602b49ccc"}],"sha":"0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/0a0adb7ac156908d77f722777f3c0778d823a2a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/d780bac1d38598515750ae5be777496602b49ccc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:57:23Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:57:23Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U7): EU5 Loan Break-Even calculator\n\nPure form/calc — NO charts (the HTML original renders Net Profit Over\nTime as a numeric horizon table, not a chart). Domain handles:\n\n- sumFactors / calcIncome: annually-compounded monthly income series\n- monthlyBaseFromProfit3yr: back-derives a monthly base from 3yr total\n- computeEu5: orchestrates loanInterest (annual or total rate),\n  effective rate from gift uplift, effectiveInterest on building cost,\n  payback (running income vs effectiveInterest), 5-row horizon table\n  (12/24/60/120/240 months), ROI at loan term and at horizon, verdict\n  tier (no-input | strong | viable | marginal | not-worth-it), and a\n  full Wait-vs-Borrow comparison with the break-even monthly income\n\nComponent: form with loan card + income card, verdict banner, stats\ngrid, numeric horizon table, side-by-side Wait/Borrow comparison.\nPer KTD #18 NO privacy disclosure (EU5 is structural scenario analysis,\nnot personal-loan input). Per the plan U7 NO @calc/charts consumption.\n\n5 fixtures (KTD #24): default, no-profit, high-income (strong verdict),\ntotal-rate variant, and gift-uplift case. Verdict tier transitions\nverified by parameter sweeps. Edge cases for payback=0 (no interest)\nand borrowBetter flag covered.\n\nWorkspace tests pass; typecheck clean.\n\nRefs: U7, R2, R6, R8, R9, R10, R11, R13, R14, R17, R19, AE3, AE4.","tree":{"sha":"669df33c701d0b3ec3f4b658ae62b325e2c6c9e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/669df33c701d0b3ec3f4b658ae62b325e2c6c9e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/d780bac1d38598515750ae5be777496602b49ccc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/d780bac1d38598515750ae5be777496602b49ccc","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKGQ3ODBiYWMxZDM4NTk4NTE1NzUwYWU1YmU3Nzc0OTY2MDJiNDljY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/dc0e8f4c1ccf783dc33c0dcae5606bee7d9af7c2","sha":"dc0e8f4c1ccf783dc33c0dcae5606bee7d9af7c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m