cts the live tier; six summary tiles + cash-requirements\nstack. Privacy disclosure rendered prominently per KTD #18 (I4 takes\npersonal-loan input).\n\nsrc/presets.ts: 5 presets a–e mirroring HTML exactly (3× Birmingham +\n4× Co-live as default; up to 7× Montana uniform).\n\ntests/Component.test.tsx: 6 RTL tests — heading, privacy disclosure,\nkit-tier selector, kit-tier reactivity (header text updates),\nAriaLive containment, preset application sets the right model count.\ntests/federation-contract.test.tsx: 3 standard contract tests.\n\napps/remote registry wires Olamina; lockfile bump for the new\ncalc-lgs-dscr devDep on the Olamina test side.\n\nWorkspace-wide tests pass: 191 across 30 files; typecheck clean.\n\nRefs: U6, R2, R6, R8, R11, R19, AE3, AE4, KTD #4, KTD #18, KTD #20.","tree":{"sha":"79dde092d30c2bfed796c3eab302575c4cc444af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/79dde092d30c2bfed796c3eab302575c4cc444af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/dc0e8f4c1ccf783dc33c0dcae5606bee7d9af7c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/dc0e8f4c1ccf783dc33c0dcae5606bee7d9af7c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKGRjMGU4ZjRjMWNjZjc4M2RjMzNjMGRjYWU1NjA2YmVlN2Q5YWY3YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/8bad39774cd19568bf0ca6f158d58ebe3ac69247","sha":"8bad39774cd19568bf0ca6f158d58ebe3ac69247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/8bad39774cd19568bf0ca6f158d58ebe3ac69247"}],"sha":"dc0e8f4c1ccf783dc33c0dcae5606bee7d9af7c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/dc0e8f4c1ccf783dc33c0dcae5606bee7d9af7c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/8bad39774cd19568bf0ca6f158d58ebe3ac69247/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:49:28Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:49:28Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U6): calc-olamina-dscr domain + cross-package agreement\n\nIndependent port per KTD #4 — every formula re-typed by hand from the\nHTML JS, no copy-paste from calc-lgs-dscr. The Olamina-specific\ndivergence is kit pricing: each model has kitPlus and kitMax tiers\n(some null), with cross-tier fallback when the requested tier is\nunavailable. computePerHome and computeDscr otherwise mirror LGS''s\nshape (intentionally — DSCR math is DSCR math).\n\nsrc/models.ts: 13 Olamina (Momo Homes) models — 5 ADUs, 8 SPHs,\nincluding upcoming flags. getKitPrice(model, tier) handles the\nnull-fallback per the HTML''s switch.\n\nsrc/domain.ts: monthlyPayment + computePerHome + computeDscr +\nvalidateDscrInputs. Identical signatures to LGS where the math overlaps;\nDscrTotals exposes `kit` instead of `module`; DscrSummary exposes\nkitBeforeDiscount instead of moduleBeforeDiscount.\n\ntests/domain.test.ts: 19 fixture-driven cases covering default preset,\nsingle-Luna max-tier, kitPlus-null fallback (Otium), zero-rate\ndegeneracy, and Plus-vs-Max parameter sweep. Plus edge cases (empty\nhomes, unknown modelId, invalid kitTier, buildOverride, rent invariant)\nand validate cases.\n\ntests/cross-package.test.ts: cross-package monthlyPayment agreement\nacross 6 textbook inputs (KTD #4 drift sentinel) plus an\nidentical-totalCost per-home agreement test that pins both packages to\nthe same totalCost via buildOverride and asserts pi/tax/ins/pitia/\nrentNeeded match to 6 decimal places. Failure here means one package\nhas a math bug.\n\nRefs: U6, R2, R6, R8, R9, R10, R11, R13, R14, R17, AE3, AE4, KTD #4.","tree":{"sha":"6543a5e09ab34ec9c8a872b443c5ffdc9d84c868","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/6543a5e09ab34ec9c8a872b4