ontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/3704e831c6a54fe2f3f022d496c141f57b48fc3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:26:58Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:26:58Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U4): Surry County Offer Component, charts, federation contract\n\nPattern-setter for U5–U9. Mirrors the HTML original''s information\narchitecture: input cards (Birchwood Sale + Offer Parameters), key\nmetrics strip, concession + proceeds breakdown cards, scenario\ncomparison table (4 presets + custom), and two charts (PITI stacked\nbars by scenario, Final Reserve single-bar with conditional color).\n\n- Component.tsx: useState + useMemo, computeOffer wrapped in AriaLive\n  per KTD #16. The four presets in src/presets.ts mirror the HTML''s\n  preset row exactly (380k/400k/415k★/425k). Concession-over-limit\n  surfaces inline as FormField error.\n- charts/PitiChart + charts/CashChart: useMemo''d Chart.js data; both\n  carry meaningful aria-labels for screen readers.\n- federation-contract.test.tsx (KTD #23): asserts default export is a\n  renderable React component, idempotent across mount cycles, and that\n  named domain symbols are co-exposed for callers wanting logic only.\n  Locks the public surface before U5–U9 inherit it.\n- ScenarioOutput now mirrors offerPrice from input so per-scenario\n  tables can read it from a single result object.\n- apps/remote calculator registry wires slug → SurryCountyOffer; route\n  tests updated since slug-echo placeholder is replaced by the real calc.\n\n5 test files / 39 tests pass: domain (22), Component (10), federation\ncontract (3), PitiChart smoke (2), CashChart smoke (2). Workspace-wide\n127 tests pass; typecheck clean.\n\nRefs: U4, R2, R4, R6, R8, R9, R10, R11, R13, R14, R15, R17, R19, F2,\nF3, AE3, AE4, KTD #20, KTD #23, KTD #24.","tree":{"sha":"b05f01978fff84c3ec94f36b4cf12012cdd02367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/b05f01978fff84c3ec94f36b4cf12012cdd02367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/3704e831c6a54fe2f3f022d496c141f57b48fc3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonsteve