gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/caad72b9b72ae03ebfc6e881064dd51a9be2cc64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:17:50Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:17:50Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"red: calc-surry-county-offer domain spec\n\nSets up the pattern-setter package skeleton (KTD #23 federation contract\ntest placeholder coming next) and a comprehensive failing spec for:\n\n- monthlyPayment: textbook 30yr@6%/$100k = $599.55, 0-rate degenerate\n  case (principal/months), and non-positive-principal defense\n- netProceedsCalc: HTML default ($97,400 for sale=280k, payoff=163k,\n  realtor=6%, transfer=1%)\n- concessionLimit: conventional-loan brackets (≤75% → 9%, ≤80% → 6%,\n  >80% → 3%) with boundary tests\n- computeOffer fixture-driven (KTD #24): 6 scenarios cover HTML default,\n  high-LTV with PMI, zero-rate degeneracy, all-zero, larger-offer preset,\n  concession-over-limit. Currency assertions use $0.01 epsilon, monthly\n  payment uses $1 epsilon (PMT involves (1+r)^n).\n- validateOfferInputs: typed validation errors keyed by field, rejecting\n  negatives and non-finite without throwing.\n\nPer-file Vitest environment (`// @vitest-environment node` for domain\ntests; defaults to jsdom for Component/charts) — equivalent enforcement\nto the plan''s nested-projects pattern but without the config sprawl.\n\nRefs: U4, R9, R10, R11, R13, R14, R15, KTD #23, KTD #24, AE3.