vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/commits/27e5ead0eb4ec781f24778ce535888e6fa679aa0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:02:54Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T04:02:54Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(U2): shell remote + harness app skeletons\n\napps/remote:\n- CalculatorsApp self-wraps BrowserRouter for direct/iframe/harness mounts\n- CalculatorsRoutes is router-less for federated hosts that already provide\n  one (KTD #20) — both delegate to a shared AppRoutes\n- CalculatorsLoadError renders text-only via String() / Error.message;\n  never dangerouslySetInnerHTML, never raw HTML (KTD #5 sanitization\n  contract). Tested with <script> and <img onerror> payloads.\n- Route-level layouts: AppLayout (header/main/footer + skip-link) for /\n  and /calc/:slug; EmbedLayout (chrome-free) for /embed/:slug. No\n  parent-context detection for /embed/* per KTD #3.\n- Calc registry (src/calculators.ts) drives both HomePage discovery and\n  unknown-slug handling, so U4–U9 just register their Component.\n- 22 RTL tests cover routing, layout selection, sanitization, and the\n  federated <CalculatorsRoutes /> integration shape.\n\napps/harness:\n- Non-federated dev mount (KTD #21). Declares @apps/remote: workspace:*\n  and consumes via the package''s \"exports\" map (\"./CalculatorsApp\", etc.)\n- vite-tsconfig-paths + Vite source-condition resolution lets TS sources\n  be imported directly without a build step on the remote side.\n\nTooling fix: vitest.shared.ts now exports only the project-shape subset\n(globals: true) — coverage/passWithNoTests/projects/reporters live on\nthe root config because Vitest 3 splits ProjectConfig and UserConfig.\n\nRefs: U2, R3, R4, R6, R8, KTD #5, KTD #20, KTD #21.","tree":{"sha":"333d9b176afc306c4e9bfa730723e0df62c38725","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/trees/333d9b176afc306c4e9bfa730723e0df62c38725"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/calculators/git/commits/27e5ead0eb4ec781f24778ce535888e6fa679aa0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/27e5ead0eb4ec781f24778ce535888e6fa679aa0","node_id":"C_kwDOSSB8ZNoAKDI3ZTVlYWQwZWI0ZWM3ODFmMjQ3NzhjZTUzNTg4OGU2ZmE2NzlhYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/calculators/commit/e1019c9dfb070fff753217931c88cac9118da33b","sha":"e1019c9dfb070fff753217931c88cac9118