://github.com/swayanshupanda","id":14983711,"login":"swayanshupanda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTgzNzEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swayanshupanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swayanshupanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swayanshupanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swayanshupanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swayanshupanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swayanshupanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/at-emp-64/apptrove-appbrew-sdk/commits/9cbb4aa2bd73837693f17d05087602096b37c599/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T08:49:06Z","email":"swayanshupanda@gmail.com","name":"Swayanshu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T08:49:06Z","email":"swayanshupanda@gmail.com","name":"Swayanshu"},"message":"docs(apptrove-sdk): add consumer integration guide\n\nThe SDK had no README, so consumers landing on the package\ndirectory had no documentation. Document the install steps\nthat the previous fix commits established:\n\n- Both apptrove-sdk and react-native-apptrove must be in the\n  host''s package.json (RN autolinker doesn''t recurse into\n  workspace packages'' transitive deps).\n- Android needs a configurations.all resolutionStrategy to\n  pin work-runtime / work-runtime-ktx to the same version.\n- Wire-up snippet for AnalyticsProvider.\n\nIncludes the AppBrew → Apptrove event ID mapping table and a\nshort troubleshooting section for the two failure modes we\nhit during initial integration. Adds a pointer from the root\nREADME so consumers find it.","tree":{"sha":"783c9fe7d870ed7326205d52e61ac5e4a34014c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/at-emp-64/apptrove-appbrew-sdk/git/trees/783c9fe7d870ed7326205d52e61ac5e4a34014c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/at-emp-64/apptrove-appbrew-sdk/git/commits/9cbb4aa2bd73837693