sin VPS (US$0/mes hasta F2)\n- platform-integration: mapa de subdominios re-asignado a node-01; auditoria de rutas\n  contra config declarativa de Traefik en suru-infra\n- group-sso: forward-auth = Traefik middleware -> Authentik proxy provider; separacion\n  /v1 vs /api de bipolar via PathPrefix nativo; perfiles OpenVPN en onboarding/offboarding\n- CLAUDE.md: doc map y nota de hosting actualizados","tree":{"sha":"e5f0219b8546e49869748a376f9f3018609294ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/git/trees/e5f0219b8546e49869748a376f9f3018609294ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/git/commits/cf7043914f2796fbd3711bdb02dca2bbe1a23105","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20863170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santiquiroz","id":20863170,"login":"santiquiroz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODYzMTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/commit/cf7043914f2796fbd3711bdb02dca2bbe1a23105","node_id":"C_kwDOSSk8l9oAKGNmNzA0MzkxNGYyNzk2ZmJkMzcxMWJkYjAyZGNhMmJiZTFhMjMxMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/commit/9e11f4d3b5991eca46921ef19a0aeb3de6eb4494","sha":"9e11f4d3b5991eca46921ef19a0aeb3de6eb4494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/commits/9e11f4d3b5991eca46921ef19a0aeb3de6eb4494"}],"sha":"cf7043914f2796fbd3711bdb02dca2bbe1a23105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/commits/cf7043914f2796fbd3711bdb02dca2bbe1a23105"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20863170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santiquiroz","id":20863170,"login":"santiquiroz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODYzMTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/commits/9e11f4d3b5991eca46921ef19a0aeb3de6eb4494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:57:15Z","email":"santiqupgui@gmail.com","name":"Santiago Quiroz upegui"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T15:57:15Z","email":"santiqupgui@gmail.com","name":"Santiago Quiroz upegui"},"message":"docs: arquitectura de infraestructura del grupo — topología multi-PC, SSO y plan de integración del portafolio\n\nNuevos:\n- docs/architecture/homelab-topology.md: nodos (VPS+Pangolin, rig GPU, node-01, NAS UGREEN), dos planos de red, cero port-forwarding, Komodo como control plane, backups 3-2-1 con escrow de secretos, fases F0-F5 con criterios de salida\n- docs/architecture/platform-integration.md: portafolio por tiers de hosteabilidad, mapa de subdominios, orden de integracion, enforcement biometrico de Argos, notas de licencias AGPL\n- docs/auth/group-sso.md: Authentik como IdP del grupo (realm interno; el Spring Authorization Server sigue siendo el realm comercial), grupos/roles, patrones de integracion por app, regimen especial de API de bipolar-code, onboarding/offboarding\n\nCorrecciones a docs existentes (decisiones anticuadas):\n- Microfrontend unificado en Module Federation 2.0 sobre Rspack (@originjs/vite-plugin-federation sin mantenimiento)\n- roadmap: deploy Railway -> VPS del grupo; dominio suruworks.com ya registrado\n- docker-compose-reference: postgres 16 -> 17 (alineado con tech-stack)\n- ux-strategy: hello@suruworks.co -> .com\n- CLAUDE.md: doc map actualizado + nota de hosting fisico\n\nBasado en research last30days 2026-08-20 y revisado con pase adversario de 4 lentes (seguridad, exactitud, consistencia, completitud) — 28 hallazgos aplicados.","tree":{"sha":"aa430af8fa4d37d1745f6fb0173cfd9f3883889c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/git/trees/aa430af8fa4d37d1745f6fb0173cfd9f3883889c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/git/commits/9e11f4d3b5991eca46921ef19a0aeb3de6eb4494","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20863170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santiquiroz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/santiquiroz","id":20863170,"login":"sant