il.com","name":"Santiago Quiroz upegui"},"message":"Documentación: plan completo de plataforma SURUworks v1.0\n\nDominio:\n- Design system MASTER.md: tokens de color, tipografía (Space Grotesk + DM Sans), espaciado 8pt, componentes (buttons, cards, inputs), checklist de accesibilidad\n- Design system páginas: landing.md (hero navy, secciones, CTA strategy) y projects.md (tool cards, estados Image-to-3D, freemium gating)\n- Brand identity: etimología SURU (japonés する), 10 alternativas de nombre evaluadas, voice guidelines, taglines\n- Spec master de diseño (2025-05-02): sitemap, service map, tech stack, fases de implementación, matriz de riesgos\n\nAplicación:\n- Auth system spec: JWT RS256 vs HS256, TTLs, rotación de refresh tokens, surface completa de API (/auth/register → /.well-known/jwks.json), snippets Java (JwtService, JwksController, JwtAuthFilter)\n- UX strategy + wireframes ASCII: 5 páginas (landing, projects, image-to-3d, services, contact), 3 user flows, content strategy\n\nInfraestructura:\n- Microservices architecture: 9 servicios, Module Federation 2.0, NATS vs Kafka análisis, PostgreSQL-per-service, Nx monorepo\n- Docker Compose reference: YAML completo con Traefik labels, healthchecks, init-dbs.sql, .env.example\n- Tech stack 2025: tabla completa con análisis por framework (Astro 5, Next.js 15, Rspack, Spring Boot 3.4, TripoSR)\n\nConfiguración:\n- CLAUDE.md: instrucciones para el agente sobre el proyecto y convenciones\n- README.md: índice general del repositorio actualizado","tree":{"sha":"a398845edfb7a7c0a42b09e5caf928777c68de80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/git/trees/a398845edfb7a7c0a42b09e5caf928777c68de80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/suru-works/SURU-roadmap/git/commits/96457dd2e574683f8df064e6de4287b90502cb63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20863170?v=4","events_url