"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Joel-Wwalker","id":127682092,"login":"Joel-Wwalker","node_id":"U_kgDOB5xGLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Joel-Wwalker/language-forge/commits/002ff1370971a7d306567ce5201b2fcfb3a23a1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T23:51:20Z","email":"theagingboy05@gmail.com","name":"Joel-Wwalker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T23:51:20Z","email":"theagingboy05@gmail.com","name":"Joel-Wwalker"},"message":"phase4-preflight Part 1: fix Seam 8 + upstream build_spec ml_like corruption\n\nTwo distinct bugs that combined to corrupt ml_like specs:\n\n1. Schema sub-properties without descriptions. The\n   structural-variance-channel work tightened parent descriptions\n   for comment_syntax and loop_forms, but the resolver weights\n   sub-property descriptions more heavily. Added family-aware\n   descriptions to comment_syntax.{line,block_open,block_close,nestable}\n   and options.loop_forms. Bumped RESOLVER_SCHEMA_VERSION 2 -> 3\n   to invalidate stale cache entries.\n\n2. Upstream build_spec bugs that produced corrupted ml_like BASE\n   specs before the resolver ever ran:\n   - The comment_style overlay''s else branch (intended for python_like)\n     was catching ml_like too, rewriting ml_like''s comment_syntax\n     to triple-quote python style. Added explicit ml_like branch.\n   - The global _DEFAULT_EXTENDED.loop_forms = [''while''] was being\n     applied to ml_like because the syntax-extended-defaults lookup\n     only fired for None-default fields. ml_like needs loop_forms=[]\n     (no while/for; recursion-only). Changed lookup to prefer\n     syntax-specific defaults over global defaults.\n\nVerified end-to-end: a fresh resolver call on a vanilla ml_like spec\nnow produces comment_syntax.block_open=''(*'' (not ''\"\"\"'') and\noptions.loop_forms=[] (not [''while'']). c_like / s_expression /\nstack_based unchanged. Full suite 1005 passing.","tree":{"sha":"81b17af8ca3f36a8be9fcd298a6c6a11bcc51e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Joel-Wwalker/language-forge/git/trees/81b17af8ca3f36a8be9fcd298a6c6a11bcc51e63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Joel-Wwalker/language-forge/git/commits/002ff1370971a7d306567ce5201b2fcfb3a23a1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127682092?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Joel-Wwalker","id":127682092,"login":"Joel-Wwalker","node_id":"U_kgDOB5xGLA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Wwalker","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Joel-W