:"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/45b07095898ef2f8cab187c21fce5f84a329cc3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T09:11:45Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T09:11:45Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"refactor: remove inline rationale comments from source\n\nThese comments narrated the single-owner rule and fire-and-forget\nreasoning behind each conversion. They belong in the commit messages\nand docs/error-handling.md, not in source: the code is self-evident\n(errkit.Report at the point of failure, no log where the handler\nreports), and the comments restate the plan''s rationale rather than\ndurable invariants a reader cannot recover.\n\nKept: the API-key security note in openrates.go (endpoint is the base\nURL, not the full request URL) and the function-level doc comments on\nreportServerFailure / reportStatusWriteFailure that match the existing\nfinance/expense pattern.","tree":{"sha":"cc464a5886b4598991777f3733691fef81de7f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/cc464a5886b4598991777f3733691fef81de7f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/45b07095898ef2f8cab187c21fce5f84a329cc3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"commi