Thompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/14a6193fbb0903a8ac59d92a360b3a9af8339d13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T08:56:33Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T08:56:33Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"Relocate reportDomain to config and tighten handler comments\n\nMove the per-service report domain tag out of the handler packages into\nconfig.ReportDomain (auth, expense, finance), updating the docs and the\nauth REST logout call site.\n\nAudit gRPC handler comments against the coding-practices skill:\n- Drop name-restating WHAT comments (NewGRPCHandler, expenseToProto,\n  GRPCHandler type docs restating the embedded server).\n- Condense the verbose reportServerFailure design narrative to a single\n  durable WHY (only 5xx errors are reported; client errors are already\n  recorded at the guard that produced them).\n- Split the merged mapServiceError/reportServerFailure doc block in the\n  expense handler and fold the per-RPC op rationale into mapServiceError.\n- Rename expense operation struct fields name->opName, rpc->rpcMethod to\n  encode role and absorb the semantic comment clauses.\n- Condense expense StreamAllUserExpenses and finance ListSupportedCurrencies\n  inline comments; trim the auth isMissingUser doc and drop the (C7)\n  planning-artifact reference.\n- Tighten the ReportDomain config docs in expense/finance to WHY-only.","tree":{"sha":"d894dc19de8f9d1e30edaa4810b900880fed2d9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/d894dc19de8f9d1e30edaa4810b900880fed2d9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/14a6193fbb0903a8ac59d92a360b3a9af8339d13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/14a6193fbb0903a8ac59d92a360b3a9af8339d13","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKDE0YTYxOTNmYmIwOTAzYThhYzU5ZDkyYTM2MGIzYTlhZjgzMzlkMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/13cb92ea600345420832343c2d4fb16ca8d714ff","sha":"13cb92ea600345420832343c2d4fb16ca8d714ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/13cb92ea600345420832343c2d4fb16ca8d714ff"}],"sha":"14a6193fbb0903a8ac59d92a360b3a9af8339d13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/14a6193fbb0903a8ac59d92a3