 failure reports service-side (the\n  pool persists the reason but never reports)\n- jobrunner pool: the four status-write failures report through\n  reportStatusWriteFailure; contexts mirror the store call (live ctx for\n  UpdateStatus/CompleteJob, background ctx for FailJob), reaching\n  Sentry via the hub-clone fallback\n- services: drop the duplicate create-job records (the REST handler\n  reports); convert the export email-resolution fire-and-forget\n- cmd: recovery failures (email resolution, recoverable-jobs query)\n  report through errkit\n- tests: engine and pool background-hub fallback assertions; fakeStore\n  gains a failErr knob","tree":{"sha":"8f47860bc6bcb98a73d05ae9fb0aaa0dcab2ccfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/8f47860bc6bcb98a73d05ae9fb0aaa0dcab2ccfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/e8a9e4bed7df6c3fd8324bed7f01d8ce2441594b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":