warn\n\nThe provider is the only possible reporter on the swallowed conversion\nsurface (expense maps ErrConversionUnavailable to Unavailable and never\nreports it), so it now owns bounded reports:\n\n- two class-scoped errkit Limiters (network/5xx under\n  fx.provider_unreachable, auth under fx.provider_auth_failed,\n  GroupExact so one outage is one Sentry issue)\n- unconditional per-occurrence site record at the terminal exit, once\n  per FetchLatest call; the per-attempt warn is deleted, so log volume\n  drops during an outage\n- recordConversion warn removed: 5xx-class failures are reported by the\n  expense handler, 4xx-class ones are client input, metrics track volume\n- go mod tidy promotes errkit to a direct dependency\n\nKnown follow-up (out of scope, pre-existing): the expense REST handler\nstill reports one event per failed request during an outage;\nErrorProviderResponseInvalid paths stay dark on the swallowed surface.","tree":{"sha":"8328bca3ddee29deaa4d83688162438de3215f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/8328bca3ddee29deaa4d83688162438de3215f9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/339df511b2e954dbf57936d5af1a297bb0320cb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https:/