pensesForPeriod, StreamAllUserExpenses, AnonymizeAllUserExpenses)\n  and GetExpenseSuggestions now surface field-level detail via v.Errors().\n- fx_client.go mapFxError INVALID_AMOUNT case now carries an \"amount\" field.\n- Top-level messages standardize to \"validation failed\"; specific detail lives\n  in field-level messages.\n- Add expense_validation_test.go covering valid/invalid/aggregation paths for\n  the previously-untested validators.\n- Update rest_test.go idempotency assertion to check Fields instead of Message.","tree":{"sha":"9c1e1695c20ce69a2a304d3b904fa1f685923713","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/9c1e1695c20ce69a2a304d3b904fa1f685923713"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/9ff72537ab37c8296a88abf96ecde0085e1034a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/9ff72537ab37c8296a88abf96ecde0085e1034a7","node_id":