,"name":"thompson"},"message":"fix: rename reportingCurrency -> reportingCurrencyCode everywhere\n\nThe initial implementation only renamed reportingCurrency on the Expense\ntype, leaving BudgetPeriod, CreatePeriodRequest, TrendResponse,\nHealthScoreResponse, and other period/budget/health/trend types with the\nold name. This created an inconsistency where the same concept (an ISO\n4217 currency code for the reporting currency) had two different field\nnames depending on the type. Rename reportingCurrency -> reportingCurrencyCode\nacross all types for consistency.\n\nFrontend:\n- All TS types (BudgetPeriod, CreatePeriodRequest, TrendResponse,\n  HealthScoreResponse, etc.) and every reference\n\nGo finance models:\n- BudgetPeriod, PeriodContext, CreatePeriodRequest, TrendPoint,\n  HealthScoreResponse, HealthScoreTrendResponse: ReportingCurrency ->\n  ReportingCurrencyCode + json tag update\n- Validation error keys and immutable-field check aligned\n- Health-score golden snapshot: bump FormulaVersion 3 -> 4, add v4.json\n\nGo finance proto:\n- PeriodData, CreatePeriodRequest, GetPeriodContextResponse:\n  reporting_currency -> reporting_currency_code (numbers kept)\n\nGo expense proto:\n- TrustedPeriodContext: reporting_currency -> reporting_currency_code\n  (number kept)\n- TrustedPeriodContext and PeriodContext Go structs: ReportingCurrency ->\n  ReportingCurrencyCode (gopls rename)\n\nGo expense/datarights:\n- Update proto getter call sites after regen\n- Finance service internal ExpenseData struct: ReportingCurrency ->\n  ReportingCurrencyCode","tree":{"sha":"8dfb95ea279cc966e6b21175e5598481922785ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/8dfb95ea279cc966e6b21175e5598481922785ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/abdd5e113820558309b80c05c55778c56a34b932","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu