","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/32f111670ed755904e3253e37b4bf4e187ec2d2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:49:37Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:49:37Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"fix: revert reportingCurrency over-replacement on non-Expense types\n\nThe global word-boundary replacement of reportingCurrency ->\nreportingCurrencyCode in the frontend also changed the field on\nBudgetPeriod, CreatePeriodRequest, TrendResponse, HealthScoreResponse,\nand other period/budget/health/trend types that were NOT in the rename\nmapping. The Go backend still expects ''reportingCurrency'' for these\ntypes, causing POST /api/finance/periods to return 400 (the period\ncreation validation rejected the unknown ''reportingCurrencyCode'' key),\nwhich made the dashboard never render ''Total Budget'' and broke all 12\ne2e tests.\n\nFix: revert reportingCurrencyCode -> reportingCurrency globally, then\nre-apply reportingCurrencyCode only on the Expense interface in\nexpenses.ts. Let tsc enumerate the Expense references that need the new\nname, and fix each. Period/budget/health/trend types correctly keep\nreportingCurrency.","tree":{"sha":"a07e38a62464d1ec5a148e94536554fd8d53b9b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/a07e38a62464d1ec5a148e94536554fd8d53b9b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos