tps://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/920b4969e59e6c1bf76fd4c035ee651246ca4a85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:18:27Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:18:27Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"test(e2e): adopt new wire keys, fix currency key\n\nUpdate e2e helpers and specs to use the new wire-contract keys.\napiCreateExpense now sends transactionCurrencyCode (previously sent\n''currency'', which the backend never read — the expense was always\ncreated with the period''s reporting currency regardless of the test\nintent). Update POST body keys and response assertions to match the\nrenamed contract.\n\n- apiCreateExpense params: amount -> amountInTransactionCurrencyMinorUnits, currency -> transactionCurrencyCode, expenseDate -> expenseDateIso\n- history-navigation, budget-period-transition: update call sites\n- expense-autocomplete: update response assertions (transactionAmount -> originalTransactionAmountInMinorUnits)","tree":{"sha":"94f4ef29a041b5f4e703cdceb2aa588e99ea0139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/94f4ef29a041b5f4e703cdceb2aa588e99ea0139"},"url":"