llowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/e676c77e8f41ef5c8c1d7b0226fed0d6a00b73f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:17:36Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:17:36Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"refactor(expense): rename proto fields, keep numbers\n\nRename expense gRPC proto message fields to self-documenting names\nwith all field numbers and reserved ranges unchanged. Regenerate pb.go\nand fix all compiler-driven gRPC caller sites.\n\nProto renames (names only, numbers kept):\n- ExpenseData: expense_date, transaction_currency, transaction_amount, reporting_amount, reporting_currency, exchange_rate, exchange_rate_expires_at\n- CreateExpenseRequest: amount, expense_date, transaction_currency\n- CorrectExpenseRequest: same three (currency field 9 stays)\n- CreateProRataInstallmentRequest: amount, transaction_currency, expense_date\n\nCaller fixes: expense grpc.go mappers (both directions), finance\ngrpc_expense_client.go (request builders + response getters), datarights\nproviders/expenses.go (stream consumer getters). All test fixtures\nupdated. Binary wire stays compatible (numbers unchanged, no persisted\nprotobuf, all clients in-repo).","tree":{"sha":"4c474da8975e7c08f60b695f81a26137a577837c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/4c474da8975e7c08f60b695f81a26137a577837c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/e676c77e8f41ef5c8c1d7b0226fed0d6a00b73f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/e676c77e8f41ef5c8c1d7b0226fed0d6a00b73f1","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKGU2NzZjNzdlOGY0MWVmNWM4YzFkN2IwMjI2ZmVkMGQ2YTAwYjczZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/62d012a9c2c21d286dacc941dcd0e4d5ac73798f","sha":"62d012a9c2c21d286dacc941dcd0e4d5ac73798f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/62d012a9c2c21d286dacc941dcd0e4d5ac73798f"}],"sha":"e676c77e8f41ef5c8c1d7b0226fed0d6a00b73f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/e676c77e8f41ef5c8c1d7b0226fed0d6a00b73f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/62d012a9c2c21d286dacc941dcd0e4d5ac73798f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:12:55Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T21:12:55Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"feat(expense): validate exchange rate source on write path\n\nAdd exchangesource.Migration const and a Valid set / IsValid func to the\nshared exchangesource package. Guard buildProviderSnapshot to reject a\nmoney snapshot whose exchange_rate_source is outside the valid set\n{open_exchange_rates, identity, migration} with an apierr.Internal error\nbefore any ledger write. The guard lives at one seam (the provider\nsnapshot builder), covering REST create, correction, and gRPC pro-rata\ninstallment paths.\n\nDatarights providers/expenses.go replaces its local migrationSource\nconst with exchangesource.Migration (dedupe).","t