reateExpenseRequest.amount -> amountInTransactionCurrencyMinorUnits\n- CorrectExpenseRequest.amount -> amountInTransactionCurrencyMinorUnits\n- ProRataSchedule.amount -> installmentAmountInMinorUnits\n- CreateProRataRequest.{totalAmount,months} -> {totalAmountInMinorUnits,spreadOverMonths}\n\nAdd ExchangeRateSource union type. Remove field comments that only\nrestate what the new name encodes; keep behavioral comments and\ninterface-level docs. Hand-edit Record-keyed error dot-access sites\n(errors.expenseDate, fieldErrors.expenseDate) that tsc/LSP cannot bind.\n\nOut-of-scope look-alikes (transactionCurrencyEffective,\ntransactionAmountEffective, reportingAmountEffective,\nreportingCurrencyEffective, selectedTransactionCurrencies) are\nunchanged.","tree":{"sha":"6cf1df32aa349892acbd558cd68a6d025b520757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/6cf1df32aa349892acbd558cd68a6d025b520757"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/05ac7703c0fa341610e80ff428b87f0815f69d95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user