s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/76c91eb6770103475a60878ee6684f34bf641d70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T18:17:22Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T18:17:22Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"fix(expense,fx,datarights): copy shared/exchangesource into Docker builds\n\nThe new shared/exchangesource module is a local-replace dependency of\nexpense, fx, and datarights. Each service Dockerfile explicitly COPYs every\nlocal-replace module''s go.mod before GOWORK=off go mod download, and the\nmodule source before the final build. The exchangesource COPY lines were\nmissing, so the e2e Docker build failed:\n\n  go: ...shared/exchangesource (replaced by ../shared/exchangesource):\n  reading ../shared/exchangesource/go.mod: open /app/shared/exchangesource/go.mod:\n  no such file or directory\n\nAdd COPY shared/exchangesource/go.mod (download phase) and\nCOPY shared/exchangesource/ (source phase) to the three Dockerfiles,\nmirroring the existing shared/currency lines. finance only imports the\nexpense/fx proto packages, which do not import exchangesource, so its\npruned module graph does not include it and it needs no change.","tree":{"sha":"7f4ea437f883c4c1287e803642472cd907131158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/7f4ea437f883c4c1287e803642472cd907131158"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/76c91eb6770103