tSchema has run in prod (prod\nbooted with the mc/04 build; the block is fail-fast, so a clean boot means\nthe DROP ran or was a no-op). Remove it from the startup path so the\none-time migration does not live in InitSchema forever.\n\nimmudb.go:\n- Delete the dropColumns slice, its comment, and the fail-fast loop.\n  InitSchema now flows from the additive-column reconcile directly to the\n  indexes.\n- Rephrase the rowToExpense required-snapshot-fields comment from the\n  mc/03-backfill narrative to the post-cutover invariant. The validation\n  itself is unchanged (kept as the data-integrity safety net).\n\nimmudb_test.go:\n- Delete the two `assert.Equal(t, 2, ... DROP COLUMN)` assertions in\n  TestInitSchema_ReconcilesSnapshotColumns and the (renamed) idempotency\n  test; after removal zero DROP statements are issued.\n- Rename alterFailingImmudbClient -> addColumnFailingImmudbClient and trim\n  its DROP branch; it now models only ADD-COLUMN \"column already exists\"\n  failures. Rewrite its doc comment.\n- Rename TestInitSchema_SwallowsColumnExistsError ->\n  TestInitSchema_SwallowsAddColumnExistsError; drop the DROP assertion and\n  reword the comment.\n- Delete dropFailingImmudbClient and TestInitSchema_DropColumnFailureFailsFast.\n- Rephrase the TestRowToExpense_MissingRequiredSnapshotFieldsErrors comment.\n\nmodel/suggestions.go:\n- Rephrase the ExpenseSuggestionInput comment to drop the mc/03 reference.\n\ndocs:\n- data-model.md / data-export.md: remove the now-false \"drops the legacy\n  amount/currency columns\" clause and scrub the gone `migration` source\n  token (ExchangeSourceMigration was removed by mc/04 and no code path\n  writes it). Rephrase to \"identity-equivalent snapshots\" and drop the\n  `migration` row from the Snapshot sources table and the export data\n  dictionary. The in-tree 000006_add_period_reporting_currency Postgres\n  migration references are unrelated and retained.\n\nVerified: gofmt/go vet clean; `go test ./...` green; grep for\nexchange_rate_source = migration / dropColumns / DROP COLUMN / mc/03 /\nbackfillMoneySnapshots returns nothing under services/expense and docs.","tree":{"sha":"cacf49807b9d365d60ffbc979afc28c42b5609fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/cacf49807b9d365d60ffbc979afc28c42b5609fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/6ad6326395c15452a4a13cd790f00ed2c5d4ed43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/6ad6326395c15452a4a13cd790f00ed2c5d4ed43","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKDZhZDYzMjYzOTVjMTU0NTJhNGExM2NkNzkwZjAwZWQyYzVkNGVkNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/ae19a594d51885e66740c5afb8669a1b6baf7e71","sha":"ae19a594d51885e66740c5afb8669a1b6baf7e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/ae19a594d51885e66740c5afb8669a1b6baf7e71"}],"sha":"6ad6326395c15452a4a13cd790f00ed2c5d4ed43",