//api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/ae19a594d51885e66740c5afb8669a1b6baf7e71","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKGFlMTlhNTk0ZDUxODg1ZTY2NzQwYzVhZmI4NjY5YTFiNmJhZjdlNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/665f3b376dc2c6f1ffa57e5fdadf5ee5c3ea9471","sha":"665f3b376dc2c6f1ffa57e5fdadf5ee5c3ea9471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/665f3b376dc2c6f1ffa57e5fdadf5ee5c3ea9471"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54","sha":"7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54"}],"sha":"ae19a594d51885e66740c5afb8669a1b6baf7e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/ae19a594d51885e66740c5afb8669a1b6baf7e71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:36:26Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:36:26Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"feat(expense): make clientGeneratedIdempotencyKey required end-to-end\n\nEliminate the legacy empty-key dual path: the idempotency key is now\nrequired on every create, propagated across the whole contract surface.\n\nService:\n- validateIdempotencyKey rejects an empty key with a 400 instead of\n  returning nil (the old \"backward compatible\" skip).\n- lookupIdempotentReplay drops the now-unreachable \"if key == \"\" \" guard;\n  every create performs the replay lookup.\n- Unified the client-facing field name across all three validation errors\n  to clientGeneratedIdempotencyKey.\n\nContract propagation:\n- proto: add client_generated_idempotency_key (field 15) to\n  CreateExpenseRequest; regenerate expense.pb.go.\n- gRPC handler maps the field into the service request (previously dropped).\n- finance GRPCExpenseClient + CreateExpenseInput carry and pass the key\n  through, so finance-originated creates honor the contract.\n- e2e apiCreateExpense sends a fresh crypto.randomUUID() per call.\n- frontend CreateExpenseRequest type: clientGeneratedIdempotencyKey is now\n  required (string), matching the backend contract.\n- model docs: request field is \"Required (RFC 4122 UUID)\"; the Expense\n  read model notes legacy rows may carry an empty key. Dropped omitempty so\n  the field is always present on new rows.\n\nTests:\n- validCreateRequest defaults to a valid key; the mock\n  GetExpenseByIdempotencyKey stubs (service + handler packages) default to\n  (nil, nil) so fresh-insert tests don''t stub the now-always-run lookup,\n  while replay tests still stub it explicitly.\n- Replace TestCreateExpense_EmptyIdempotencyKeyPreservesBehavior (which\n  pinned the legacy path) with TestCreateExpense_MissingIdempotencyKeyRejected\n  asserting a 400 before any repo call.\n- Add TestCreateExpenseHandler_MissingIdempotencyKey asserting the 400 body\n  and that no lookup/insert occurs.\n- gRPC and REST handler success-path create requests include a valid UUID.\n\nPro-rata (CreateProRataInstallment) is intentionally excluded: it is a\nserver-to-server call and mints a fresh pro-rata group per finance call,\nso a client double-submit produces separate schedules rather than\nduplicate rows an expense-side key would dedup. Idempotency for that path,\nif ever wanted, belongs at finance''s POST /api/finance/prorata boundary.","tree":{"sha":"15b993ca8eee4d632f9899437a3185f8aeec5720","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/15b993ca8eee4d632f9899437a3185f8aeec5720"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKDdjMmYwMDc2Mzk3NTNiZmY1MmI4Nzk1NmEzZTQ5NjAyNTM2MGNhNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9","sha":"bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9"}],"sha":"7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/7c2f007639753bff52b87956a3e496025360ca54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:49:56Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:49:56Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"refactor(expense): flatten idempotent-replay nesting and trim redundant repo doc comments\n\nExtract the idempotent-replay lookup from CreateExpense into\nlookupIdempotentReplay, replacing the three-level nested if block\nwith flat guard clauses. The helper absorbs the empty-key\nshort-circuit, so CreateExpense no longer wraps the replay checks\nin an outer ''if key != \"\"'' guard.\n\nAlso drop redundant per-method doc comments on the\nExpenseRepository interface and SQLResult/SQLRow/SQLValue types;\nthe remaining comments cover the non-obvious cases.","tree":{"sha":"d9caabf7a254da11b822b147ee724b73bfaf3016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/d9caabf7a254da11b822b147ee724b73bfaf3016"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKGJmODc2NDA2MDdjYmJjNDZhYzZjZDIxNWRlYjkyYWFlNWNlNjljYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/8604f0cbfcef94aad9fbe48b75cf671e486b8fb8","sha":"8604f0cbfcef94aad9fbe48b75cf671e486b8fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/8604f0cbfcef94aad9fbe48b75cf671e486b8fb8"}],"sha":"bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/bf87640607cbbc46ac6cd215deb92aae5ce69cc9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/8604f0cbfcef94aad9fbe48b75cf671e486b8fb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:25:46Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T15:26:29Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"refactor(expense): rename idempotencyKey to clientGeneratedIdempotencyKey\n\nRename the create-expense idempotency key field to a self-documenting\nname across both sides of the wire contract: the Go model/request\nstructs (field name + json tag) and the TypeScript Expense /\nCreateExpenseRequest interfaces, plus the form hook and tests that\nbuild or assert the POST body.\n\nGo references were renamed with gopls (semantic rename), so\nidentifiers that merely contain the substring but are out of scope --\nGetExpenseByIdempotencyKey, validateIdempotencyKey, and the\nTestCreateExpense_*IdempotencyKey* test names -- are untouched, as is\nthe immudb column key \"idempotency_key\".\n\nAlso trim the now-redundant field doc comments: the field name plus\nomitempty convey \"optional, client-generated\", while the behavioral\nnote (retry returns the existing expense; empty means no idempotency)\nis retained.\n\nWire contract: the create endpoint JSON key changes from\nidempotencyKey to clientGeneratedIdempotencyKey, so frontend and\nbackend must deploy together.","tree":{"sha":"9e522a3038b5a2f91f9563f2722c2932ebcf9d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/9e522a3038b5a2f91f9563f2722c2932ebcf9d93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/8604f0cbfcef94aad9fbe48b75cf671e486b8fb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"h