mail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"docs: fix pre-existing doc drift surfaced by the revalidation\n\nAddress the report-only findings the audit agents flagged as\npre-existing (non-epic) staleness, each re-verified against code.\n\napi.md: add `/readyz` to the route-level access table; correct the list\nendpoint claim (pagination + period scoping only; sorting/filtering is\nclient-side); document the admin-only datarights deletion endpoint group.\n\narchitecture.md: fix the Prometheus observability bullet (scrapes\ncadvisor and node-exporter too, over monitoring-net); add cadvisor and\nnode-exporter to the monitoring-net table; add a datarights deletion\nbullet.\n\ndata-model.md: add finance health scores + the reporting-currency\nmigration audit table and datarights deletion jobs to the ownership\ntable; align the FX row to the configurable cache; remove the embedded\nexport_jobs CREATE TABLE (drift hazard) in favor of a migration\nreference; add a deletion_jobs subsection.\n\ndata-export.md: fix the stale provider-factory signature\n(`func(financeData *financepb.AllUserDataResponse)`) and drop the\nremoved `MemoizedFinanceClient`; describe the single per-job\nGetAllUserData fetch.\n\nci-cd.md: correct the E2E health-wait target to\n`localhost:8080/metrics` (the gateway has no unauthenticated\n`/api/health` check).\n\ntesting.md: clarify that `just test-backend` covers auth, expense,\nfinance, fx, and gateway; datarights runs via its own module (CI\niterates go.work).\n\ndocker-compose.dev.yml: correct the FX overlay comment (it also sets\nENVIRONMENT and a placeholder OER app id, not just volumes and ports).","tree":{"sha":"e05ede97c5aeced0d97212ec8d40810624819084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/e05ede97c5aeced0d97212ec8d40810624819084"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/d4b660bf6c754adbf8ce35a4fcfe610edb713cc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,