rl":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/2c60c20bb5403a0a086387ca7c1d1bd316d73d9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:27:00Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:27:00Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"message":"docs: revalidate multi-currency docs against current code\n\nThe mc/07 docs were drafted from the multi-currency epic spec, but PR\nreviews on mc/01-06 then deleted several spec''d behaviors: the legacy\n`currency` alias, the legacy pro-rata migration path, the\nMISSING_CAPTURED_RATE_SNAPSHOT error code, deprecated response mirrors,\nthe startup money-snapshot backfill, and the app-fallback reporting\ncurrency. Revalidate every multi-currency doc claim against the code and\nfix the stale ones; document only what the code does today.\n\napi.md: drop the legacy `currency` alias section, its telemetry table, and\nthe CURRENCY_FIELD_CONFLICT / MISSING_CAPTURED_RATE_SNAPSHOT rows; document\nGET /api/finance/currencies (Authenticated); make reportingCurrency +\nbudgetAmount required on period create; remove deprecated suggestion\nmirrors; document transactionCurrency defaulting and correction-preserve.\n\narchitecture.md + README.md: add FX Service and Open Exchange Rates to the\narchitecture diagram and feature list; drop \"tag ownership\" from the\nperiod-context API; fix money-snapshot and configurable FX-cache wording.\n\ndata-model.md: fix the pro_rata failure_reason enum (only\nSNAPSHOT_CURRENCY_MISSING is typed; transient failures stay pending);\ncorrect the legacy-column drop and the deleted startup backfill; point\nthe currency catalog at services/shared/currency/catalog.go served via\nGET /api/finance/currencies; document the 000006 audit table.\n\ndata-export.md: document incomplete-snapshot and unsupported-currency\nexport behavior and the period-currency fallback for migration rows.\n\nmonitoring.md: fix the FX log fields; delete the spec-framed \"defined,\nnot wired\" alert table, keeping only the deployed ServiceDown coverage.\n\ndevelopment.md, initial-setup.md, testing.md, ci-cd.md, .env.example: add\nFX Service local-dev/ports/env, the OER app-id production checklist, the\nFX converter test row, the fx-service rollback image, and the static\nrate-1 fallback warning.","tree":{"sha":"151c804f42d801a623af40f5ca1a7eff7929ec9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/151c804f42d801a623af40f5ca1a7eff7929ec9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/2c60c20bb5403a0a086387ca7c1d1bd316d73d9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://