legacy pro-rata migration path and shorten doc comment\n\nPer PR review feedback, the repo owner confirmed no legacy pending\nschedules exist on prod. The entire legacy migration code path is\ndead code that adds complexity for a problem that doesn''t exist.\n\nRemoved across both services:\n- Finance: applyLegacyProRataSchedule method, LegacyMigration field\n  from CreateProRataInstallmentInput, ErrMissingCapturedRateSnapshot\n  error code, TransactionCurrency-to-Currency fallback, gRPC client\n  forwarding\n- Expense: legacy migration branch in CreateProRataInstallment,\n  buildMigrationSnapshot function, LegacyMigration field from\n  CreateProRataInstallmentRequest, ExchangeSourceMigration constant,\n  gRPC handler forwarding\n- Proto: legacy_migration field 13 replaced with reserved declaration\n- Tests: removed 4 legacy-specific tests, updated 3 finance tests\n  to use captured snapshots instead of the legacy path, renamed 1 test\n\nAlso shortened the applyPendingProRata doc comment from 13 lines to\n2 lines (explain WHY not WHAT), and updated the stale ''legacy rows''\ncomment in the ProRataSchedule model.\n\n+42/-299 lines across 12 files.","tree":{"sha":"7c3cf4d4a95f6b21cd273877b37336c77977a6d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/7c3cf4d4a95f6b21cd273877b37336c77977a6d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/cba35d678deccb7fb129c99562a2b64f33507a84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"logi