":"Thompson"},"message":"fix(finance): classify Expense snapshot_currency_missing as deterministic\n\nExpense-side defense-in-depth can surface a snapshot_currency_missing\nfailure that Finance''s target-only pre-check does not cover (e.g. the\ntransaction currency is missing from the captured snapshot). Previously\nany Expense error left the schedule pending, stranding it for a retry that\nwould fail identically. classifyProRataExpenseError now inspects the\nreturned error (in-process *apierr.Error or wrapped gRPC\ncodes.FailedPrecondition) and moves the row to failed with\nsnapshot_currency_missing when the failure is deterministic; transient\nerrors still leave the row pending. Also add a failed count to the\napply summary log for at-a-glance operator correlation.\n\nAddresses review-14 should-fix S1.","tree":{"sha":"4894653317395e44c249dca805b0bc6deccb1543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/4894653317395e44c249dca805b0bc6deccb1543"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/abbd2fdb13ec8a84cf624d177ec3436a5f3baa08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/abbd2fdb13ec8a84cf624d177ec3436a5f3baa08","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKGFiYmQyZmRiMTNlYzhhODRjZjYyNGQxNzdlYzM0MzZhNWYzYmFhMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f","sha":"ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f"}],"sha":"abbd2fdb13ec8a84cf624d177ec3436a5f3baa08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/abbd2fdb13ec8a84cf624d177ec3436a5f3baa08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:42:10Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:58:44Z","email":"33135895+ItsThompson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thompson"},"message":"test(finance,expense): cover pro-rata future application and legacy failures\n\nAdd finance service tests for captured-snapshot same/different target\ncurrency, missing snapshot currency, expense write failure, legacy\nsame-currency migration application, legacy different-currency failure,\nand the no-target-period-remains-pending invariant, plus a dashboard\nexcludes-pending-and-failed assertion. Add expense service tests for the\nlegacy migration write, currency-mismatch rejection, different-target\nsnapshot conversion, missing-target-currency rejection, and expense\nwrite failure. Update existing CreatePeriodWithProRata tests to the new\nCreateProRataInstallment contract and wire the MarkProRataFailed mock.","tree":{"sha":"8bf7fe227f59a887e62d649b135f11199c02fcbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/8bf7fe227f59a887e62d649b135f11199c02fcbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKGVjMWEzMGE5NDgwYTI5NWM0ZmVlZjU2MDE2NGFiZmY3MDU4OWMzNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a","sha":"9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a"}],"sha":"ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/ec1a30a9480a295c4feef560164abff70589c36f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:42:07Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:58:44Z","email":"33135895+ItsThompson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thompson"},"message":"feat(finance): apply pending pro-rata via trusted context and captured snapshot\n\nRewrite applyPendingProRata to resolve the target reporting currency from\nthe just-created Finance period, pass trusted period context plus the\ncaptured snapshot to Expense (no reentrant Finance call, no live provider\nrate), and mark each schedule applied only after the ledger write\nsucceeds. Deterministic failures (missing snapshot currency, legacy\ndiffering currency) move the row to failed with a typed reason; transient\nExpense write/conversion failures leave the row pending so it can be\nretried, with no partial expense row visible. Each schedule is applied\nindependently so one failure does not block the rest.","tree":{"sha":"be9bcdf4d6c8dffd98cb2753d2a48303abe0f13d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/be9bcdf4d6c8dffd98cb2753d2a48303abe0f13d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a","node_id":"C_kwDOSSu7ltoAKDliZDE0YWVkMTI1MWRmYjcyY2U2MjNlNWZkZmJmM2NiNmI4ZTdiMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson/gofin/commit/db0e05971878b8df3a472d9991ca89de8912a69f","sha":"db0e05971878b8df3a472d9991ca89de8912a69f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/db0e05971878b8df3a472d9991ca89de8912a69f"}],"sha":"9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/9bd14aed1251dfb72ce623e5fdfbf3cb6b8e7b1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/commits/db0e05971878b8df3a472d9991ca89de8912a69f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:42:04Z","email":"hi.thompson@hotmail.com","name":"thompson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:58:44Z","email":"33135895+ItsThompson@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thompson"},"message":"feat(expense,finance): legacy migration pro-rata path with migration snapshot\n\nAdd a legacy_migration flag to the CreateProRataInstallment contract so\nFinance can apply legacy pending schedules whose target period reporting\ncurrency equals the stored schedule currency. Expense writes a migration\nsnapshot (exchangeRate = \"1\", exchangeRateSource = \"migration\") without\ncalling FX, and re-validates the currency match so a caller error never\ninvents a conversion. Regenerate the expense proto.","tree":{"sha":"048eb3271659165f5a9e48db0d4e3bf8b6af2cd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/trees/048eb3271659165f5a9e48db0d4e3bf8b6af2cd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ItsThompson/gofin/git/commits/db0e05971878b8df3a472d9991ca89de8912a69f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33135895?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ItsThompson","id":33135895,"login":"ItsThompson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTM1ODk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ItsThompson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.co