4abe1ed64478094c8dddd1797c","node_id":"C_kwDOSSyqG9oAKDQ1NWJkZTc1Y2RkMWU0NGFiZTFlZDY0NDc4MDk0YzhkZGRkMTc5N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/33prime/dr-better-sleep-anchorage/commit/e731f8eed286120d18765f4d20fb0e1fd3a96983","sha":"e731f8eed286120d18765f4d20fb0e1fd3a96983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/33prime/dr-better-sleep-anchorage/commits/e731f8eed286120d18765f4d20fb0e1fd3a96983"}],"sha":"455bde75cdd1e44abe1ed64478094c8dddd1797c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/33prime/dr-better-sleep-anchorage/commits/455bde75cdd1e44abe1ed64478094c8dddd1797c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147274900?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/33prime","id":147274900,"login":"33prime","node_id":"U_kgDOCMc8lA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/33prime","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/33prime/dr-better-sleep-anchorage/commits/e731f8eed286120d18765f4d20fb0e1fd3a96983/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T00:27:24Z","email":"147274900+33prime@users.noreply.github.com","name":"33prime"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T00:27:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Rebrand to Dr. Never Snore brand guidelines (v1.0) (#1)\n\nApply the May 2026 brand standards across the app:\n\n- Color: replace the Anchorage forest-green/teal-black palette with the\n  brand system — Midnight Blue #1E2544 (dark surfaces / \"Dr. Never Snore:\n  Teal on Midnight Blue\" primary usage), Clean White #FFFFFF (light surfaces\n  / \"Midnight Blue on White\" secondary usage), Restful Teal #43BACA (accent,\n  CTAs, interactive), Soft Salmon #E5898B (on-palette attention/secondary).\n  142 color replacements across screens, components, and the device shell.\n- Type: switch the entire app to Nunito (the single brand typeface) and\n  retire Manrope / Instrument Serif / JetBrains Mono. Display headings bumped\n  to ExtraBold/Black per the brand typographic hierarchy; data uses tabular\n  figures; labels are Bold uppercase.\n- Logo: add the Dr. Never Snore wordmark with the crescent-moon motif in the\n  period after \"Dr.\" (teal product name), placed at onboarding and the device\n  overview.\n- Voice: drop \"cure\" from the boil-and-bite copy (\"all it takes to set\").\n- Metadata/PWA: name -> Dr. Never Snore, theme/background -> Midnight Blue,\n  on-brand description; index.html title + meta updated.\n\nContrast-safe accent usage: teal CTAs/bubbles use Midnight Blue text.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matt Edmund <matt@ebmitchell.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76115ab559398c83e8e979e302bf226fcdb9e698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/33prime/dr-better-sleep-anchorage/git/trees/76115ab559398c83e8e979e302bf226fcdb9e698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/33prime/dr-better-sleep-anchorage/git/commits/e731f8eed286120d18765f4d20fb0e1fd3a96983","verification":{"payload":"tree 76115ab559398c83e8e979e302bf226fcdb9e698\nparent 1db30885493eebf669b57dc649dfec0dc463df7c\nauthor 33prime <147274900+33prime@users.noreply.github.com> 1780619244 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780619244 +0200\n\nRebrand to Dr. Never Snore brand guidelines (v1.0) (#1)\n\nApply the May 2026 brand standards across the app:\n\n- Color: replace the Anchorage forest-green/teal-black palette with the\n  brand system — Midnight Blue #1E2544 (dark surfaces / \"Dr. Never Snore:\n  Teal on Midnight Blue\" primary usage), Clean White #FFFFFF (light surfaces\n  / \"Midnight Blue on White\" secondary usage), Restful Teal #43BACA (accent,\n  CTAs, interactive), Soft Salmon #E5898B (on-palette attention/secondary).\n  142 color replacements across screens, components, and the device shell.\n- Type: switch the entire app to Nunito (the single brand typeface) and\n  retire Manrope / Instrument Serif / JetBrains Mono. Display headings bumped\n  to ExtraBold/Black per the brand typographic hierarchy; data uses tabular\n  figures; labels are Bold uppercase.\n- Logo: add the Dr. Never Snore wordmark with the crescent-moon motif in the\n  period after \"Dr.\" (teal product name), placed at onboarding and the device\n  overview.\n- Voice: drop \"cure\" from the boil-and-bite copy (\"all it takes to set\").\n- Metadata/PWA: name -> Dr. Never Snore, theme/background -> Midnight Blue,\n  on-brand description; index.html title + meta updated.\n\nContrast-safe accent usage: teal CTAs/bubbles use Midnight Blue text.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matt Edmund <matt@ebmitchell.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIhfsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGHcQAJxo+qgWqczwJgRBc+diUmJ3\naNknnX1mX+CdfqDhZ90CHR4zWSwgSbZ+lP69s96EefC8sSJP8eV5h3bZ5goPD5y+\nBQZVPa79edBpuzMuBI856M/S0XoyWFEeX9AaFnTPEJQheJkpejZHRA74qdMCnhts\nPWmNDWe4WnSuJCV9ZTHpgT8m1w3gnRPKp32/n8jmwNJi10A++mUc9/y0MY2ePVCH\nsDa2Fa9MoBQuhqnR9y5BE3PFKLoRTK2RdDSxd6uusk50wM9L/74pS4BvcLLnfeog\nz4zz95oVMyZJ7+Z3ikltZ6FYuMfPoP0upLHjUQp0XF/M1isqnaXMeWUVlMd3xkSj\nXUCJljMY4jVCo2kF6Mh7/T6FG3zoS20OjPhbMJsEB7vXSI4mMlJ3jb6o9m+56K/r\nWyAaUkoOOUBV7VUefImOLiwh08P1qJu1VHtWbJTVONnsdo0DlZ8x9IqUu3lfezpj\nhZt6GcE/dXneFscJKsCCDtlYR/RPvyTdB9HKq39NPX8fKuW4XqGUGu3A4Avo8KR1\ni+WLtziKCJe8xw5bbW5Unq+SmknRwmDnSqm6r7/1+TtxG3Gx3oj6